(window.PL_LANG_Q = window.PL_LANG_Q || []).push([{"Cindy":"辛迪","...You again. I heard you ran Team Rocket out of the well.":"……又是你。聽說你把火箭隊趕出了井裡。","Those Rocket clowns only act tough in a crowd. I cannot stand people like that.":"火箭隊那幫小丑只敢成群結隊地逞強。我最受不了那種人。","But I didn't come for them. I came to beat you!":"不過我不是為他們來的。我是來打敗你的！","...Tch. My Pokémon were too weak. I'll get stronger ones, whatever it takes.":"……嘖。是我的寶可夢太弱了。不管用什麼辦法，我都要弄到更強的。","Bug Pokémon are full of surprises. I am going to keep studying them, and one day I will know them all!":"蟲寶可夢充滿了驚喜。我會繼續研究牠們，總有一天我會了解所有的蟲寶可夢！","Hm? A Trainer? I am Kurt. I make Poké Balls out of Apricorns.":"嗯？是訓練家嗎？我是鋼鐵，用球果製作精靈球的。","But there is no time for that now! Team Rocket is back, and they are cutting off the Slowpoke's tails in the well to sell them!":"不過現在沒空管那個了！火箭隊又回來了，他們在井裡割呆呆獸的尾巴拿去賣！","I will not stand for it. I am going down there to teach them a lesson myself!":"我絕不允許！我要親自下去教訓他們！","Ouch... I jumped down the ladder and hurt my back. I can barely move!":"哎喲……我從梯子上跳下來，把腰扭到了。幾乎動不了了！","Please, drive Team Rocket out for me. The Slowpoke are counting on you!":"拜託你，替我把火箭隊趕走吧。呆呆獸們就靠你了！","Fine! We are pulling out. We cut enough tails already, anyway.":"好吧！我們撤。反正尾巴也割得夠多了。","{player}! You did it! The Slowpoke are safe. Let us get out of here. Come and see me at my house.":"{player}！你做到了！呆呆獸們得救了。我們出去吧。來我家找我。","You chased Team Rocket out of the well. The Slowpoke are safe, thanks to you!":"你把火箭隊趕出了井裡。多虧了你，呆呆獸們平安無事！","My back still hurts, though... Oh, and Bugsy is back at his Gym. He came running when he heard the news.":"不過我的腰還是好痛……對了，阿筆回到他的道館了。他一聽到消息就跑回來了。","The Gym's door is locked. A note on it reads: \"Out looking for rare bugs. Back soon! Bugsy\"":"道館的門鎖著。門上貼著一張紙條：「出門找稀有的蟲子去了。馬上回來！阿筆」","Yo, Champion! Bugsy uses Bug-type Pokémon. Fire and Flying moves will do the trick.":"喲，冠軍！阿筆用的是蟲屬性的寶可夢。火屬性和飛行屬性的招式很管用。","With one Johto badge, Pokémon up to level 25 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 30!":"有一枚城都徽章，25級以下的寶可夢會聽你的。在這裡贏了，就能提高到30級！","Okay, you win. This is yours: the Hive Badge.":"好吧，你贏了。這個給你：昆蟲徽章。","{player} received the Hive Badge from Bugsy!":"{player}從阿筆那裡得到了昆蟲徽章！","With the Hive Badge, Pokémon up to level 30 will listen to you.":"有了昆蟲徽章，30級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話。","Take this too: TM17, Protect. Bug Pokémon survive by hiding in their shells. With Protect, any Pokémon can do the same for a turn.":"這個也給你：招式學習器17，守住。蟲寶可夢會躲進殼裡求生。用了守住，任何寶可夢都能在一回合裡做到同樣的事。","This well is closed. Team business. ...What? No, we are definitely not doing anything to the Slowpoke. Move along!":"這口井封閉了。組織的事。……什麼？沒有，我們絕對沒對呆呆獸做什麼。走開走開！","The Slowpoke have all vanished from town... I saw strange people in black near the well.":"鎮上的呆呆獸全都不見了……我看到井邊有一些穿黑衣服的怪人。","The Slowpoke are back! When they yawn, rain is sure to follow.":"呆呆獸們回來了！牠們一打哈欠，就一定會下雨。","Kurt makes Poké Balls out of Apricorns. People come from all over Johto to see him!":"鋼鐵用球果製作精靈球。城都各地的人都會來找他！","The Gym Leader, Bugsy, knows everything about Bug Pokémon. And he is barely older than me!":"道館館主阿筆對蟲寶可夢無所不知。而且他只比我大一點點！","A Slowpoke, yawning in the sun. It is glad to be home.":"一隻在曬太陽打哈欠的呆呆獸。牠很高興能回家。","A Slowpoke. It stares at nothing in particular.":"一隻呆呆獸。牠正呆呆地望著前方。","Have you met Kurt? His Poké Balls are famous, but these days he is busy with the Slowpoke trouble.":"你見過鋼鐵嗎？他做的精靈球很有名，不過最近他在為呆呆獸的事煩心。","Union Cave is full of Zubat. Repels sell well in this town!":"互連洞裡全是超音蝠。所以除蟲噴霧在這個鎮上很好賣！","Grandpa ran off to the well... I hope he is all right.":"爺爺跑去井那邊了……希望他沒事。","A Slowpoke's tail grows back, Grandpa says. But it must still hurt. Thank you for saving them!":"爺爺說呆呆獸的尾巴還會再長出來。但一定還是很痛吧。謝謝你救了牠們！","A Slowpoke. Its tail has been cut short, but it only yawns.":"一隻呆呆獸。牠的尾巴被割短了，可牠只是打了個哈欠。","A Slowpoke, dozing. It does not seem to know anything is wrong.":"一隻在打瞌睡的呆呆獸。牠好像完全不知道出了什麼事。","Who let a kid down here? Get lost!":"誰讓小鬼下來的？滾開！","Ugh... I lost.":"呃……我輸了。","Slowpoke tails are a delicacy, you know. They sell for a fortune!":"呆呆獸的尾巴可是美味佳餚，能賣大價錢呢！","We are busy here. Do not make me deal with you!":"我們正忙著呢。別逼我收拾你！","I got dealt with...":"結果是我被收拾了……","Team Rocket is back! Did you not hear?":"火箭隊回來了！你沒聽說嗎？","Those Slowpoke do not even notice when we cut their tails. So why should you care?":"那些呆呆獸被割尾巴都沒感覺。你憑什麼多管閒事？","Okay, okay. You care a lot.":"好吧好吧，看來你很在乎。","The one in charge is at the back. He will deal with you.":"負責的人在最裡面。他會收拾你的。","So you made it all the way down here. I am in charge of this job, and you are not ruining it!":"你居然一路走到這裡來了。這次的任務由我負責，你別想壞我的事！","Unbelievable... a kid beat me.":"難以置信……居然被小鬼打敗了。","Benny":"小本","Bugs evolve fast, and so do I! Battle!":"蟲子進化得快，我也一樣！來對戰！","My bugs needed more time...":"我的蟲子還需要更多時間……","Bugsy studies how Bug Pokémon grow. He is a real scientist!":"阿筆在研究蟲寶可夢是怎麼成長的。他是個真正的科學家！","You cannot reach Bugsy without getting past me!":"不打敗我，你就別想見到阿筆！","Squashed...":"被壓扁了……","Fire moves are tough on bugs. That is no secret.":"火屬性的招式對蟲子很有效。這可不是什麼祕密。","Paras grow mushrooms on their backs. Cool, right? Battle!":"派拉斯背上會長蘑菇。很酷吧？來對戰！","My mushrooms wilted...":"我的蘑菇蔫了……","Bugsy's Scyther is fast and sharp. Watch out!":"阿筆的飛天螳螂又快又鋒利。小心點！","I am Bugsy! I may be young, but nobody has studied Bug Pokémon more than me. Let me show you what I have learned!":"我是阿筆！我雖然年紀小，但論研究蟲寶可夢，誰也比不過我。讓你看看我學到的東西吧！","Whoa, amazing! You really know your Pokémon.":"哇，太厲害了！你真的很了解你的寶可夢。","Azalea Town. A sleepy old town that loves its Slowpoke.":"檜皮鎮。一個深愛著呆呆獸、慢悠悠的古老小鎮。","Azalea Town Pokémon Gym. Leader: Bugsy, a young expert on all things Bug-type!":"檜皮鎮寶可夢道館。館主：阿筆，精通一切蟲屬性知識的少年專家！","Slowpoke Well. Long ago, they say, the yawn of a Slowpoke ended a terrible drought here.":"呆呆獸之井。據說很久以前，一隻呆呆獸打了個哈欠，就結束了這裡的大旱災。","West: Ilex Forest. Fallen trees block the path for now.":"西：櫟樹林。道路暫時被倒下的樹擋住了。","Apricorns of every colour, sorted by size.":"各種顏色的球果，按大小排得整整齊齊。","Tools for making Poké Balls by hand.":"手工製作精靈球的工具。","I make charcoal in the kiln out back. My apprentice took our Farfetch'd to Ilex Forest to cut wood. He should be back by now...":"我在屋後的窯裡燒炭。我的徒弟帶著我們的大蔥鴨去櫟樹林砍柴了。他早該回來了啊……","Our Farfetch'd cuts the wood for the kiln with its leek. Without it, there would be no charcoal. Thank you again!":"我們的大蔥鴨用牠的蔥幫窯砍柴。沒有牠，就燒不出炭來。再次謝謝你！","I will never let go of Farfetch'd again. Well... I will try.":"我再也不會讓大蔥鴨離開我身邊了。嗯……我會努力的。","Farfetch'd waves its leek proudly.":"大蔥鴨得意地揮舞著牠的蔥。","Suicune stands before you, as calm as clear water.":"水君站在你面前，如清水般平靜。","Suicune is still there, waiting for you.":"水君還在那裡等著你。","So Suicune chose you... I am a little jealous. But I saw it up close, and that is enough for me.":"原來水君選擇了你……我有點羨慕。不過我能近距離看到牠，這就夠了。","Listen! Roars from the west, from the Burned Tower. The bell has called Raikou and Entei back too!":"聽！西邊的燒焦塔傳來了吼聲。鐘聲把雷公和炎帝也召喚回來了！","{player}! You have the Clear Bell too? Then look, over there!":"{player}！你也有透明鈴鐺？那你快看那邊！","Suicune... It came here, as if the bell had called it. And it is looking at you, not at me.":"水君……牠來到了這裡，就像被鐘聲召喚來的一樣。而且牠看著的是你，不是我。","Go on. I have chased it for ten years; the least I can do now is watch.":"去吧。我追了牠十年，現在至少能在一旁看著。","Suicune is waiting for you. Go on, I will watch from here.":"水君在等你。去吧，我在這裡看著。","Raikou and Entei went back to the Burned Tower, where they were reborn. They are waiting too.":"雷公和炎帝回到了牠們重生的燒焦塔。牠們也在等你。","All three have answered. Now climb! I have a feeling the rainbow Pokémon is close.":"三隻都回應了。快上去吧！我感覺彩虹色的寶可夢就在附近。","Ho-Oh, Suicune, Raikou, Entei... I will remember this tower for the rest of my life.":"鳳王、水君、雷公、炎帝……這座塔我一輩子都不會忘記。","The Clear Bell rings by itself, high and clear...":"透明鈴鐺自己響了起來，清脆而嘹亮……","A great rainbow-coloured Pokémon comes down onto the top of the tower!":"一隻巨大的彩虹色寶可夢降落在塔頂！","Ho-Oh is still there, its wings shining like a rainbow.":"鳳王還在那裡，翅膀像彩虹一樣閃耀。","A rainbow spreads over Ecruteak City. The legend of the two towers has come full circle.":"一道彩虹橫跨圓朱市上空。兩座塔的傳說終於畫上了圓滿的句號。","A Sage stands by the stairs: Three Pokémon must answer the bell before anyone may climb.":"一位賢者守在樓梯旁：三隻寶可夢回應了鐘聲之後，才能讓人上去。","Three Pokémon were reborn in the fire of the Burned Tower. Until all three answer the bell, the stairs stay closed.":"三隻寶可夢在燒焦塔的大火中重生。在牠們三個都回應鐘聲之前，樓梯不會開放。","All three have answered the bell. The stairs are open: climb, and the rainbow Pokémon will judge you at the top.":"三隻都回應了鐘聲。樓梯已經開放：上去吧，彩虹色的寶可夢會在塔頂考驗你。","Gaku":"阿岳","The tower tests everyone who climbs it. I am the first test!":"這座塔會考驗每個攀登的人。我就是第一道考驗！","You may pass...":"你可以過去了……","Every floor of this tower is built without a single nail. Our ancestors were wise.":"這座塔的每一層都沒用一根釘子。我們的祖先真是有智慧。","Masa":"阿正","Spirits drift through this tower at night. Mine will drift through you!":"夜裡會有幽靈在這座塔裡飄盪。我的幽靈會穿過你！","My spirits have scattered...":"我的幽靈都散了……","Two stairs lead up from here. Only one of them takes you higher.":"這裡有兩道樓梯往上走。只有一道能讓你繼續往上。","Koji":"浩二","Bellsprout sway like the tower in the wind. Bend, but never break!":"喇叭芽就像風中的塔一樣搖擺。能彎，但絕不會斷！","I bent... and broke.":"我彎了……然後斷了。","The tower sways a little in strong winds. That is why it has never fallen.":"強風吹來時塔會稍稍搖晃。正因如此，它從來沒有倒過。","Sohei":"宗平","My Xatu sees the past and the future. In both, I see myself winning!":"我的天然鳥能看見過去和未來。兩邊都是我贏！","I saw it wrong...":"我看錯了……","The top is just above. Be still, and the rainbow Pokémon may come to you.":"塔頂就在上面。靜下心來，彩虹色的寶可夢也許會來到你身邊。","The elder of Ecruteak must hear about this. Go and tell him what you saw!":"得讓圓朱市的長老知道這件事。快去告訴他你看到了什麼！","...You. So you made it to Blackthorn too.":"……是你。原來你也到煙墨市了。","Lance trained in this cave. I came to see what made him so strong. All I found was an old man asking questions.":"阿渡曾在這個洞穴裡修行。我來看看是什麼讓他變得那麼強。結果只碰到一個愛問問題的老頭。","He told me to come back when I understand my Pokémon. They battle, I win. What else is there to understand?":"他叫我等理解了自己的寶可夢再來。牠們戰鬥，我贏。還有什麼好理解的？","...Forget it. Stay out of my way.":"……算了。別擋我的路。","Your Pokémon fainted after a hard battle. What do you do first?":"你的寶可夢在一場苦戰後倒下了。你會先做什麼？","Rush it to a Pokémon Center":"趕緊帶牠去寶可夢中心","Send out the next one":"派出下一隻","Scold it for losing":"罵牠輸了","A Pokémon you just caught will not listen to you. What do you do?":"剛抓到的寶可夢不聽你的話。你會怎麼做？","Train it until it obeys":"訓練到牠聽話為止","Spend time with it until it trusts me":"多陪陪牠，直到牠信任我","Let it go":"放走牠","What makes a Trainer truly strong?":"什麼才能讓訓練家真正變強？","Never losing":"從不輸","Growing together with their Pokémon":"和寶可夢一起成長","Is a weak Pokémon worth raising?":"弱小的寶可夢值得培養嗎？","Every Pokémon can grow strong":"每隻寶可夢都能變強","No, only the strong ones matter":"不，只有強的才重要","Only if it evolves":"除非牠會進化","Hmm... I see.":"嗯……原來如此。","May the dragons watch over you on the road to the Pokémon League.":"願龍在你前往寶可夢聯盟的路上守護你。","Welcome to the Dragon Shrine. The dragon clan has trained here for generations.":"歡迎來到龍之祠。龍之一族世世代代都在這裡修行。","The shrine's test is only for those Clair sends to me. Go and face her first.":"只有小椿派來的人才能接受祠堂的考驗。你先去挑戰她吧。","Ah, a Trainer Clair sent. She sends me everyone who beats her. She never could admit a defeat.":"啊，是小椿派來的訓練家。打敗她的人，她都會送到我這裡來。她從來都不肯認輸。","I will ask you a few questions. There is no trick to them: answer as you truly feel.":"我要問你幾個問題。沒有陷阱：照你的真心回答就好。","Every answer came from the heart. Your Pokémon are lucky to have you.":"每個回答都發自內心。你的寶可夢能遇到你真是幸運。","Some of your answers surprised me. But I can see that your Pokémon trust you, and that is what matters most.":"有幾個回答讓我有些意外。不過我看得出你的寶可夢信任你，這才是最重要的。","Clair! Come in. This Trainer has passed.":"小椿！進來吧。這位訓練家通過了。","...So the Elder approves of you. Fine. I keep my word.":"……既然長老認可了你。好吧，我說話算話。","I was wrong to keep the badge from you. Here: the Rising Badge.":"是我不該扣著徽章不給你。拿去吧：升龍徽章。","{player} received the Rising Badge from Clair!":"{player}從小椿那裡得到了升龍徽章！","With the Rising Badge, Pokémon of every level will obey you.":"有了升龍徽章，任何等級的寶可夢都會聽你的話。","And take this: TM02, Dragon Claw. It slashes with claws as sharp as a dragon's.":"還有這個：招式學習器02，龍爪。用像龍一樣鋒利的爪子撕裂對手。","With eight badges you may enter the Pokémon League. Surf east from New Bark Town along Route 27, and Victory Road will lead you there.":"集齊八枚徽章就能進入寶可夢聯盟。從若葉鎮沿27號道路往東衝浪，冠軍之路會帶你到那裡。","Next time we battle, I will not lose. Remember that!":"下次對戰，我不會再輸了。給我記住！","Before you go, take this Dratini. It hatched here at the shrine, and it should see the world with a Trainer like you.":"走之前，把這隻迷你龍帶上吧。牠是在祠堂裡出生的，應該跟著你這樣的訓練家去看看世界。","It knows {move}, a move no Dratini learns by itself. A gift for one who answered so well.":"牠會{move}，這是迷你龍自己學不會的招式。送給回答得這麼好的你。","I am the Move Deleter. I can make a Pokémon forget a move, even one from an HM. Shall I?":"我是招式遺忘者。我能讓寶可夢忘掉招式，就算是秘傳學習器的招式也行。要試試嗎？","Come again if you need me.":"需要的話隨時再來。","Forget a move: which Pokémon?":"忘記招式：哪隻寶可夢？","{mon} knows only one move. I cannot take it away.":"{mon}只會一個招式。這個我可不能讓牠忘掉。","Which move should it forget?":"要忘掉哪個招式？","Make {mon} forget {move}?":"要讓{mon}忘掉{move}嗎？","Done! {mon} forgot {move}.":"好了！{mon}忘掉了{move}。","Yo, Champion! The last Johto Gym! Clair uses Dragon types. Ice and Dragon moves hit them hard.":"嗨，未來的冠軍！這是城都最後一座道館！小椿使用龍屬性。冰屬性和龍屬性的招式對牠們很有效。","See the chasms? Push the boulders into the holes with Strength and walk across. Fall, and you start over from here!":"看到那些深淵了嗎？用怪力把石頭推進洞裡，就能走過去。掉下去的話就得從這裡重來！","With seven Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 70 obey you. Win here, and they all will!":"有七枚城都徽章，70級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話。在這裡贏了，所有寶可夢都會聽你的！","Hmph. You won, I admit it. But my badge is not something I hand over for one battle.":"哼。你贏了，我承認。但我的徽章可不是贏一場就能拿走的。","North of this Gym, across the water, is the Dragon's Den. The Elder of our clan lives in its shrine. If he says you are worthy, the badge is yours.":"這座道館北邊，過了水就是龍穴。我們一族的長老住在裡面的祠堂。如果他認為你夠格，徽章就歸你。","The Pokémon League is at the end of Victory Road. Surf east from New Bark Town along Route 27. Do not lose before you get there!":"寶可夢聯盟在冠軍之路的盡頭。從若葉鎮沿27號道路往東衝浪。在到達之前可別輸了！","What are you waiting for? The Dragon's Den is north of the Gym, across the water. Go and face the Elder.":"還在等什麼？龍穴在道館北邊，過了水就到。去見長老吧。","Across the pond is the Dragon's Den. The Elder of the dragon clan keeps the shrine inside. Lance trained there as a boy.":"池塘對面就是龍穴。龍之一族的長老守著裡面的祠堂。阿渡小時候就在那裡修行。","Clair wears a cape just like her cousin Lance. Everyone in town knows they are family.":"小椿和她的堂兄阿渡一樣披著斗篷。鎮上的人都知道他們是一家人。","You came through the Ice Path? Brr! The Pokémon Center is the place to warm up.":"你是從冰之洞過來的？好冷！去寶可夢中心暖和暖和吧。","Clair's dragons shrug off Fire, Water, Grass and Electric moves. Ice and Dragon moves are what hurt them.":"小椿的龍不怕火、水、草和電屬性的招式。能傷到牠們的是冰和龍屬性的招式。","You have all eight Johto badges? Then the Pokémon League is next. Victory Road waits for you!":"你集齊城都的八枚徽章了？那下一站就是寶可夢聯盟了。冠軍之路在等著你！","The dragon clan has lived in Blackthorn for generations. Clair and Lance are its most famous Trainers.":"龍之一族世世代代住在煙墨市。小椿和阿渡是族裡最有名的訓練家。","Dragons are strong, but they hate the cold. I always carry Ice moves when I visit Blackthorn.":"龍很強，但是很怕冷。我來煙墨市的時候總會帶著冰屬性招式。","Clair's Gym is the last one in Johto. Trainers who win there go on to the Pokémon League.":"小椿的道館是城都最後一座道館。在那裡贏了的訓練家就會前往寶可夢聯盟。","Lance is from Blackthorn, you know. He has a Dragonite! When I grow up I want one too.":"阿渡是煙墨市出身的哦。他有一隻快龍！我長大了也想要一隻。","Three Dratini, raised together. Can you handle all of them?":"三隻一起長大的迷你龍。你對付得了嗎？","Dratini shed their skin as they grow. One day mine will be as big as Clair's.":"迷你龍會一邊蛻皮一邊長大。總有一天我的會和小椿的一樣大。","You pushed a boulder across the chasm? Not bad. But dragons do not need bridges!":"你把石頭推進去過了深淵？還不錯。不過龍可不需要橋！","My dragons came down to earth...":"我的龍落地了……","Clair trains harder than anyone in the clan. She cannot stand losing.":"小椿比族裡任何人都努力訓練。她最受不了輸。","Only one more chasm between you and Clair. I am the last wall!":"你和小椿之間只剩一道深淵了。我就是最後一道牆！","The wall came down.":"牆倒了。","Clair will not go easy on you just because you made it this far.":"就算你走到了這裡，小椿也不會手下留情的。","So you crossed the Ice Path and my chasms. I am Clair, and dragons answer to me. Not even the Elite Four take me lightly. Show me everything you have!":"你穿過了冰之洞，還越過了我的深淵啊。我是小椿，龍都聽命於我。就連四天王也不敢小看我。把你的本事全拿出來吧！","My dragons... beaten? That cannot be.":"我的龍……輸了？這不可能。","Darin":"達林","Outsiders in the Dragon's Den? You will have to get past me first.":"外人闖進龍穴？先過我這一關再說。","So you are the one Clair sent...":"原來你就是小椿派來的人……","Only those the clan trusts may cross to the shrine. Go on, then.":"只有一族信任的人才能渡水去祠堂。那你去吧。","Cara":"卡拉","The water here is home to dragons. Mine grew up in it!":"這裡的水是龍的家。我的寶可夢就是在這裡長大的！","Wild Dratini live in this water. If you are lucky, you might hook one.":"這片水裡住著野生的迷你龍。運氣好的話，說不定能釣到一隻。","The Elder sees into the hearts of Trainers. Nothing is hidden from him.":"長老能看透訓練家的內心。什麼都瞞不過他。","Clair and Lance both learned here. Lance passed the Elder's test on his first try, they say.":"小椿和阿渡都在這裡學習過。聽說阿渡第一次就通過了長老的考驗。","Elder":"長老","Move Deleter":"招式遺忘者","Blackthorn City. A quiet town in the mountains, home of the dragon clan.":"煙墨市。寧靜的山間城鎮，龍之一族的故鄉。","North, across the water: the Dragon's Den. Sacred ground of the dragon clan. Do not disturb.":"北邊，過水即到：龍穴。龍之一族的聖地。請勿打擾。","Blackthorn City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Clair, the proud Dragon Trainer.":"煙墨市寶可夢道館。館主：小椿，驕傲的龍使。","South: Route 45, a steep road down the mountains to Route 46.":"南：45號道路，一條陡峭的山路，下山通往46號道路。","Eggs are a mystery. Some say Pokémon find them, others that they appear by themselves. What do you think?":"蛋真是個謎。有人說是寶可夢找到的，也有人說是自己冒出來的。你覺得呢？","Ah, there you are! Professor Elm said a Trainer would come by. I am Mr. Pokémon. I travel and collect odd things.":"啊，你來了！空木博士說會有一位訓練家過來。我是寶可夢爺爺，喜歡到處旅行，收集稀奇古怪的東西。","A friend of mine who runs the Day Care gave me this. Nobody knows what it is! Elm will want to study it.":"這是我一個開培育屋的朋友給我的。沒人知道這是什麼！空木一定會想研究牠。","{player}! What a surprise to see you here in Johto!":"{player}！沒想到會在城都見到你！","Mr. Pokémon and I are old friends. Let me see your Pokédex... There! Now it records the Pokémon of Johto too.":"我和寶可夢爺爺是老朋友了。讓我看看你的圖鑑……好了！現在它也能記錄城都的寶可夢了。","Hm? A call from Elm... What! Someone broke into his lab and stole a Pokémon?":"嗯？空木打來的電話……什麼！有人闖進他的研究所偷走了寶可夢？","{player}, hurry back to New Bark Town! Elm needs you.":"{player}，快回若葉鎮吧！空木需要你。","...So you got one from that lab too. Some people get everything handed to them.":"……原來你也從那個研究所拿了一隻。有些人什麼都是別人送到手上的。","Let's see if you even deserve it. I'll knock you down!":"讓我看看你配不配。我會把你打趴下！","...Tch. One win means nothing. I'll be the strongest Trainer there is, and nobody will stand in my way.":"……嘖。贏一次不算什麼。我會成為最強的訓練家，誰也別想擋我的路。","Johto has Pokémon I have never seen in Kanto. Fill that Pokédex, {player}!":"城都有很多我在關都從沒見過的寶可夢。把圖鑑填滿吧，{player}！","Oh, {player}! Talk to Mr. Pokémon first. He has something to show you.":"哦，{player}！先去跟寶可夢爺爺聊聊吧。他有東西要給你看。","Welcome to Cherrygrove! The Pokémon Center heals for free, the Mart sells Poké Balls, and the sea is lovely at sunset.":"歡迎來到吉花市！寶可夢中心免費治療，友好商店賣精靈球，傍晚的大海也很美哦。","Johto Pokémon swim out there too. Got a rod? Give it a try!":"那邊的海裡也有城都的寶可夢在游。有釣竿嗎？試試看吧！","My Pidgey was tired, so I brought it here. Pokémon Centers are the same in Kanto and Johto!":"我的波波累了，所以帶牠來這裡。關都和城都的寶可夢中心都一樣呢！","Antidotes are a must. Bug Pokémon on Route 30 love to poison you!":"解毒藥是必備的。30號道路的蟲屬性寶可夢最喜歡讓人中毒了！","Some Pokémon evolve once they really love their Trainer. Battle together, walk together, and see!":"有些寶可夢真正喜歡上訓練家以後就會進化。一起戰鬥、一起走路，就知道了！","Joey":"阿喬","My Rattata is one in a million! Want to see? Battle!":"我的小拉達是萬裡挑一的！想見識一下嗎？來對戰吧！","What? My one-in-a-million Rattata!":"什麼？我那萬裡挑一的小拉達！","I am going to make my Rattata even stronger. You will see!":"我要讓我的小拉達變得更強。你等著瞧吧！","Mikey":"小麥","Hey, a Trainer! You know the rule: our eyes met, so we battle!":"嘿，是訓練家！規矩你懂的：視線對上了，就要對戰！","Wow. You are the real deal.":"哇，你是真的厲害。","Pidgey and Rattata are everywhere. That makes them easy to train!":"到處都有波波和小拉達，所以訓練起來很方便！","I caught a bunch of Caterpie! Want to see them?":"我抓了一大堆綠毛蟲！想看看嗎？","My Caterpie need more training.":"我的綠毛蟲還需要多加訓練。","Caterpie evolve quickly. Soon they will be Butterfree!":"綠毛蟲進化得很快。很快就會變成巴大蝶了！","My bag is full of bugs! Let them all have a go at you!":"我的包裡裝滿了蟲子！讓牠們一起上吧！","Not enough bugs, I guess.":"看來蟲子還不夠多啊。","At night, Spinarak come out in the grass. They are bugs too!":"到了晚上，草叢裡會出現圓絲蛛。牠們也是蟲子哦！","Cherrygrove City. Sweet-smelling flowers on every street.":"吉花市。每條街上都開著芬芳的花。","Route 30. North: Mr. Pokémon's house. West: Route 31 to Violet City.":"30號道路。北：寶可夢爺爺的家。西：31號道路，通往桔梗市。","Shelves full of curiosities from all over the world.":"架子上擺滿了世界各地的稀奇玩意兒。","Route 31. West: Violet City.":"31號道路。西：桔梗市。","Ah, {player}! Elm told me about your Egg. Splendid! Now let me show you something from my collection.":"啊，{player}！空木跟我說了你那顆蛋的事。太棒了！現在讓我給你看看我的收藏吧。","Did you know a Pokémon can hold an item? Not one you use from your Bag: the Pokémon keeps it, and uses it by itself in battle.":"你知道寶可夢可以攜帶道具嗎？不是從包包裡使用的那種：寶可夢會自己拿著，在對戰中自己使用。","A Berry it eats when it is hurt, a charm that makes its moves stronger... Here, try these two.":"受傷時吃的樹果、讓招式變強的護身符……來，你試試這兩樣。","Give one to a Pokémon from your party or your Bag, then come and show me. The Goldenrod Department Store has a new counter for held items too!":"從隊伍或包包裡把道具交給寶可夢拿著，然後拿來給我看看。滿金百貨也新開了一個攜帶道具的櫃台哦！","Oh! Your {mon}! I have something in my collection that was made for it alone. Here, it should have it.":"哦！你的{mon}！我的收藏裡有一樣專門為牠準備的東西。來，就該給牠。","My collection grows every year. If you meet a Pokémon I have never seen, bring it to me!":"我的收藏每年都在增加。要是你遇到了我沒見過的寶可夢，就帶來給我看吧！","Give an item to one of your Pokémon, then show me. Choose it in your party, or give it from your Bag.":"把道具交給你的寶可夢拿著，再拿來給我看看。可以在隊伍裡選，也可以從包包裡給。","Yes, just like that! It will use its item without you saying a word.":"對，就是這樣！牠會自己使用道具，不用你說一句話。","If you ever find something truly rare, do show it to me. I would trade you the best piece of my collection for it.":"要是你找到了真正稀有的東西，一定要給我看看。我願意用收藏裡最好的寶貝跟你換。","Hm? What is that shining in your Bag? A red scale... from the red Gyarados of the Lake of Rage? I have never seen one!":"嗯？你包包裡閃閃發光的是什麼？紅色的鱗片……是憤怒之湖那條紅色暴鯉龍的？我從沒見過！","Would you trade it for the best piece of my collection?":"能用我收藏裡最好的寶貝跟你換嗎？","Ah... If you change your mind, I will be right here.":"啊……要是你改變主意了，我一直都在這裡。","The Pokémon that holds the Exp. Share gets part of the Exp. from every battle, even if it never fights. Raise your young ones with it!":"拿著學習裝置的寶可夢，即使不出場戰鬥，也能分到每場對戰的一部分經驗值。用它來培養你的新夥伴吧！","Oh, and Professor Oak stopped by. Your old rival {rival} went up Mt. Silver to train, and nobody has seen him since. The way is south of the Pokémon League Front Gate, on Route 28.":"對了，大木博士來過。他說你以前的勁敵{rival}上了白銀山修行，之後就再也沒人見過他。路在寶可夢聯盟大門的南邊，28號道路上。","A blue Pokémon with a flowing mane stands on the beach, looking at you...":"一隻有著飄逸鬃毛的藍色寶可夢站在海灘上，看著你……","{mon} turned and ran off across the waves!":"{mon}轉過身，踏著海浪跑走了！","Suicune! I saw it! It was here, right here! Did it look at you? Lucky...":"水君！我看到了！牠就在這裡，就在這兒！牠看你了嗎？真幸運……","It ran off over the sea again. One day it will stop running, and I will be there.":"牠又從海上跑走了。總有一天牠會停下腳步，那時我一定會在那裡。","The Pokémon that lights the Olivine Lighthouse is sick? Then this is what you need.":"照亮淺蔥燈塔的寶可夢生病了？那你需要的就是這個。","Our Secret Potion. One dose, and it will be shining again. Hurry back to Olivine!":"這是我們的秘傳之藥。只要喝一劑，牠就會重新發光。快回淺蔥市吧！","Welcome to the Cianwood Pharmacy. We have medicines you will not find in any Mart.":"歡迎光臨湛藍藥店。我們有在友好商店買不到的藥。","My husband trains too much. But I would not want him any other way.":"我丈夫訓練得太拼了。不過我就喜歡他這樣。","Oh, a Trainer! My husband is the Gym Leader, Chuck. He trains from dawn to dusk.":"哎呀，是訓練家！我丈夫是道館館主阿四。他從早到晚都在訓練。","Here, take this. It is his favourite move: it makes a Pokémon stronger and tougher at once.":"來，這個給你。這是他最喜歡的招式：能同時讓寶可夢變得更強、更結實。","WAHAHAH! I am going back under the waterfall. I will be even stronger next time!":"哇哈哈哈！我要回瀑布底下修行了。下次我會變得更強！","Yo, Champion! Chuck uses Fighting types. Flying and Psychic moves are what they fear.":"喲，冠軍！阿四用的是格鬥屬性的寶可夢。牠們害怕飛行和超能力屬性的招式。","The boulders in here need Strength. And his Poliwrath can put you to sleep: bring Awakenings!":"這裡的大石頭需要用怪力推開。還有，他的蚊香泳士會催眠：記得帶解眠藥！","With four Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 40 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 50!":"有四枚城都徽章，40級以下的寶可夢會聽你的。在這裡贏了，就能提高到50級！","WAHAHAH! Here! The Storm Badge! You have earned it!":"哇哈哈哈！拿去！打擊徽章！這是你應得的！","{player} received the Storm Badge from Chuck!":"{player}從阿四那裡得到了打擊徽章！","With the Storm Badge, Pokémon up to level 50 will listen to you.":"有了打擊徽章，50級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話。","Take this too! TM01, Focus Punch! Gather all your power, then strike! Just do not get hit while you gather it!":"這個也拿去！招式學習器01，真氣拳！集中全身的力量，然後一拳打出去！只是蓄力的時候可別被打中！","I swam all the way out to this sandbank. Now I am too tired to swim back!":"我一路游到這片沙洲。現在累得游不回去了！","The sea is my training ground. Let's make waves!":"大海就是我的訓練場。來掀起浪花吧！","Washed out...":"被沖走了……","Watch out for Tentacool. They sting!":"小心瑪瑙水母。牠們會螫人！","Elaine":"伊蓮","Staryu shines like a jewel in the water. Isn't it pretty?":"海星星在水裡像寶石一樣閃閃發光。很漂亮吧？","My jewel lost its shine...":"我的寶石失去光澤了……","At night the Lighthouse light reaches all the way out here.":"到了晚上，燈塔的光一直照到這裡。","Swimming is good for you, and so is battling!":"游泳對身體好，對戰也是！","I need a rest on the sand...":"我得在沙灘上休息一下……","Cianwood is a long swim west. Take a break on the sandbank!":"往西游到湛藍市還有很遠。在沙洲上歇一歇吧！","Randall":"阿蘭道","The currents around the islands are fierce. Only the strong swim here!":"島嶼周圍的海流很猛烈。只有強者才能在這裡游泳！","Swept away...":"被捲走了……","A huge Pokémon is said to sleep deep inside the Whirl Islands.":"據說漩渦列島的深處沉睡著一隻巨大的寶可夢。","Kaylee":"凱莉莉","Seaking swims as gracefully as a dancer. Watch!":"金魚王游起來像舞者一樣優雅。看好了！","Out of step...":"亂了節拍……","Seaking fight over the best spots in the river. Even in the sea, they are proud.":"金魚王會為了爭奪河裡最好的位置而打架。就算在海裡，牠們也很驕傲。","I have swum around all four islands today. One more battle!":"我今天繞著四座島游了一圈。再來一場對戰！","Cianwood is just west of here. Its Gym Leader trains under a waterfall!":"湛藍市就在西邊。那裡的道館館主在瀑布底下修行！","Suicune was right here! It ran off over the waves before I could get close. But I will catch up with it, you will see!":"水君剛才就在這裡！我還沒靠近，牠就踏著海浪跑掉了。不過我一定會追上牠的，你等著瞧！","Chuck trains under a waterfall every morning. He shouts so loud you can hear him across town!":"阿四每天早上都在瀑布底下修行。他喊得超大聲，全鎮都聽得到！","The rocks here are full of Shuckle. They keep Berries in their shells until they turn to juice.":"這裡的岩石間住著很多壺壺。牠們把樹果藏在殼裡，直到變成果汁。","I came to train with Chuck. Three days in, I can barely lift my arms!":"我是來跟阿四一起修行的。才三天，我的手臂就快抬不起來了！","People sail all the way from Olivine for the medicine here.":"大家會從淺蔥市坐船過來買這裡的藥。","A Poliwrath, flexing its arms. Even Chuck's house Pokémon trains.":"蚊香泳士正在秀肌肉。就連阿四家裡的寶可夢也在鍛鍊。","A blue Pokémon with a long mane runs across the water as if it were land. They call it the north wind's spirit.":"有一隻長著長鬃毛的藍色寶可夢，能像在陸地上一樣在水面奔跑。人們叫牠北風的化身。","Chuck looks scary, but he is a big softy with his wife. She is the real boss of the house!":"阿四看起來很可怕，但在老婆面前可溫柔了。她才是家裡真正的老大！","Yoshi":"阿吉","Hyah! My kicks are sharper than any sword!":"哈！我的踢腿比任何刀劍都鋒利！","My legs gave out...":"我的腿沒力了……","Chuck can punch a boulder out of the way. You will need Strength.":"阿四一拳就能把大石頭打開。你得用怪力才行。","Lao":"阿勞","Punch after punch! Can you keep up?":"一拳接一拳！你跟得上嗎？","Out-punched...":"拳頭輸了……","Fighting types hate Psychic and Flying moves. Do not tell Chuck I said so.":"格鬥屬性最怕超能力和飛行屬性的招式。別告訴阿四是我說的。","I train every day with Chuck. Feel the power!":"我每天都和阿四一起修行。感受一下這股力量吧！","More training...":"還得多練……","Machoke wears a belt to hold back its strength. Scary, right?":"豪力繫著腰帶來壓住自己的力量。很嚇人吧？","Lung":"阿龍","My Mankey get angry fast. And angry means strong!":"我的猴怪很容易生氣。生氣就代表很強！","They are even angrier now...":"牠們現在更生氣了……","Chuck's Poliwrath can put you to sleep and then punch. Bring Awakenings!":"阿四的蚊香泳士會先讓你睡著再出拳。記得帶解眠藥！","WAHAHAH! So you came all the way across the sea to battle me? I am Chuck! My Pokémon and I train under the waterfall every day. Come on, let us see your strength!":"哇哈哈哈！你是特地渡海來跟我對戰的嗎？我就是阿四！我和我的寶可夢每天都在瀑布底下修行。來吧，讓我看看你的力量！","Hwaaah! You are strong! I am shocked!":"哇啊——！你好強！我太震驚了！","Sea Route 40. Olivine City to the east, Cianwood City far to the west.":"40號水路。東邊是淺蔥市，往西很遠是湛藍市。","Cianwood City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Chuck, whose fists do the talking.":"湛藍市寶可夢道館。館主：阿四，用拳頭說話的男人。","Cianwood Pharmacy. Our secret recipes have healed Pokémon for five hundred years.":"湛藍藥店。我們的祕方治療寶可夢已有五百年歷史。","Cianwood City. A port town of rough seas and rough rocks.":"湛藍市。海浪洶湧、岩石嶙峋的港口城市。","Whirl Islands. Fierce whirlpools swirl in front of the caves. Only a Pokémon that knows Whirlpool can calm them.":"漩渦列島。洞窟前捲著猛烈的漩渦。只有會潮旋的寶可夢才能讓它們平靜下來。","Whoa, careful! It is so dark in here that I cannot even see my own boots.":"哇，小心！這裡黑得我連自己的靴子都看不見。","The last earthquake dropped rocks all over these passages. I have been smashing my way through them for days.":"上次地震讓這些通道到處都是落石。我已經一路敲碎它們走了好幾天了。","You look like you need this more than I do. HM06 is Rock Smash: a Pokémon that knows it can break cracked rocks.":"看來你比我更需要這個。秘傳學習器06是碎岩：會這招的寶可夢可以敲碎有裂縫的岩石。","Sometimes a Pokémon is hiding under a rock. The Dunsparce here love the dark!":"有時候岩石底下會躲著寶可夢。這裡的土龍弟弟最喜歡黑暗了！","Smash the cracked rocks and keep going. They say there is a hollow somewhere in here where the sun comes in.":"敲碎有裂縫的岩石，繼續往前走吧。聽說這裡面某個地方有一處窪地，陽光會照進來。","Light pours in through a crack high above. In the middle of the sunlit hollow, a lone tree is hung with black fruit.":"光線從高處的裂縫傾瀉而下。在灑滿陽光的窪地中央，一棵孤零零的樹上掛著黑色的果實。","Gordon":"戈登","I come down here to train in the dark. My Pokémon can feel their way better than any light!":"我來這裡是為了在黑暗中修行。我的寶可夢摸黑走路比開著燈還要厲害！","I did not see that coming. Then again, I see nothing down here.":"沒看出來會這樣。不過話說回來，在這底下我本來就什麼都看不見。","The rocks here are all cracked from the last earthquake. A good Rock Smash clears them.":"這裡的岩石都在上次地震時裂開了。用碎岩就能把它們清掉。","Kaito":"海斗","Training in total darkness sharpens every sense. Let me test mine on you!":"在一片漆黑中修行，能磨練所有的感官。讓我拿你來試試我的感官吧！","My senses were sharp, but your Pokémon were sharper.":"我的感官很敏銳，可你的寶可夢更敏銳。","Past that rock, the river runs to a place where light comes down from above. Strange, in a cave like this.":"過了那塊岩石，河水會流到一個有光從上方照下來的地方。在這樣的洞穴裡，真是奇怪。","...You again. I came here because people said a legendary Pokémon sleeps under this tower.":"……又是你。我來這裡，是因為聽說這座塔下面沉睡著傳說中的寶可夢。","If I catch a legendary Pokémon, nobody will ever beat me. Not even you. Starting now!":"只要抓到傳說中的寶可夢，就再也沒人能打敗我。就連你也不行。現在就來證明！","...Hmph. This tower is a waste of time. Nothing here but rubble and old stories.":"……哼。這座塔根本是浪費時間。除了瓦礫和老掉牙的故事，什麼都沒有。","Three Pokémon are sleeping in the dust. As you come closer, they open their eyes...":"三隻寶可夢在塵土中沉睡著。你一走近，牠們就睜開了眼睛……","{mon} jumped out through the broken floor and ran off!":"{mon}從破損的地板躍了出去，跑走了！","Did you see that? Suicune! The one I have chased for ten years!":"你看到了嗎？水君！我追尋了十年的水君！","I am Eusine. Legends say a great Pokémon brought three Pokémon back to life here, after the fire: Raikou, Entei and Suicune.":"我叫阿桔。傳說那場大火之後，一隻偉大的寶可夢在這裡讓三隻寶可夢復活了：雷公、炎帝和水君。","Now they are awake and running all over Johto. I will find Suicune before anyone else does!":"現在牠們醒了，正在城都各地奔跑。我一定要比任何人都先找到水君！","Long ago, Ecruteak had two towers. In the east, the Bell Tower; in the west, the Brass Tower.":"很久以前，圓朱市有兩座塔。東邊是鈴鐺塔，西邊是黃銅塔。","One night, lightning struck the Brass Tower. It burned for three days, until rain from the sky put the fire out.":"某天夜裡，閃電擊中了黃銅塔。大火燒了三天三夜，直到天降大雨才熄滅。","Three Pokémon died in the fire. But a great rainbow Pokémon came down from the sky and brought them back to life.":"有三隻寶可夢死在了那場大火裡。但一隻彩虹色的偉大寶可夢從天而降，讓牠們復活了。","That is the story. The burned tower has stood empty ever since... or so they say.":"故事就是這樣。從那以後，燒焦的塔就一直空著……至少大家是這麼說的。","What a show! The Kimono Girls dance even better after a good battle.":"真是精彩的表演！舞子們打完一場好對戰後，跳得更好了。","Battle all five Kimono Girls, young one, and I will give you something special.":"年輕人，去和五位舞子都對戰一次吧，我會送你特別的東西。","Bravo! You beat all five Kimono Girls. Such battles deserve a reward. Here!":"太精彩了！你打敗了五位舞子。這樣的對戰值得獎勵。拿去吧！","The legendary Pokémon chose to run from us. But I believe one of them will appear before you, one day.":"傳說中的寶可夢選擇了離我們而去。但我相信，總有一天牠們之中會有一隻出現在你面前。","Suicune runs like the north wind and purifies dirty water. I have to see it again!":"水君像北風一樣奔跑，能淨化污濁的水。我一定要再見牠一面！","If you meet it before me, tell me everything!":"要是你比我先遇到牠，一定要全部告訴我！","I am Morty, the Gym Leader of Ecruteak. They say three Pokémon sleep under this tower, waiting for the right Trainer.":"我是圓朱市的道館館主松葉。據說這座塔下沉睡著三隻寶可夢，在等待命中注定的訓練家。","The floor is broken in places. Careful you do not fall through... or maybe that is exactly what you should do.":"地板有些地方已經塌了。小心別掉下去……或者，那正是你該做的。","The Gym is empty. A note on the door reads: \"At the Burned Tower. Morty\"":"道館裡沒有人。門上的紙條寫著：「我在燒焦塔。松葉」","A Sage blocks the way: Only those the Bell Tower accepts may enter. Please go back.":"一位和尚擋住了去路：只有被鈴鐺塔認可的人才能進入。請回吧。","Yo, Champion! Morty uses Ghost types. Normal and Fighting moves pass right through them, but Dark and Ghost moves hit hard.":"喲，冠軍！松葉用的是幽靈屬性的寶可夢。一般和格鬥屬性的招式會直接穿過牠們，但惡屬性和幽靈屬性的招式很有效。","The floor here is hard to see. Step off the path and you will be back at the door. Watch where the Trainers stand!":"這裡的地面很難看清楚。一離開道路，就會回到門口。留意訓練家站的位置吧！","With three Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 35 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 40!":"有三枚城都徽章，35級以下的寶可夢會聽你的。在這裡贏了，就能提高到40級！","You have earned this. The Fog Badge.":"這是你應得的。幻影徽章。","{player} received the Fog Badge from Morty!":"{player}從松葉那裡得到了幻影徽章！","With the Fog Badge, Pokémon up to level 40 will listen to you.":"有了幻影徽章，40級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話。","And take this: TM30, Shadow Ball. A ball of shadow that can lower the target's defence against special moves.":"還有這個：招式學習器30，暗影球。這團暗影球能降低對手的特防。","Long ago, a rainbow-coloured Pokémon perched on top of the Bell Tower. We still wait for it to come back.":"很久以前，一隻彩虹色的寶可夢曾棲息在鈴鐺塔頂。我們至今仍在等牠回來。","The Burned Tower was struck by lightning, and it burned for three days! My grandpa told me.":"燒焦塔被閃電擊中，燒了整整三天！是我爺爺告訴我的。","We Kimono Girls dance at the theater. Come and watch us, and maybe battle us too!":"我們舞子在歌舞練場跳舞。來看看吧，說不定還能和我們對戰哦！","Morty, our Gym Leader, went to the Burned Tower. He says something sleeps beneath it.":"我們的道館館主松葉去了燒焦塔。他說那下面沉睡著什麼。","Three Pokémon ran out of the Burned Tower! They were gone before I could even blink.":"有三隻寶可夢從燒焦塔裡衝了出來！我還沒眨眼，牠們就不見了。","The road north of Ecruteak leads to Mahogany Town and the Lake of Rage. I heard there is a red Gyarados up there!":"圓朱市北邊的路通往卡吉鎮和憤怒之湖。聽說那裡出現了一隻紅色的暴鯉龍！","Ghost Pokémon put you to sleep and then eat your dreams. Bring Awakenings to Morty's Gym!":"幽靈寶可夢會讓你睡著，再吃掉你的夢。去松葉的道館記得帶上解眠藥！","Grandpa tells that old story every night. I know it by heart!":"爺爺每天晚上都講那個老故事。我都會背了！","My son wants to be a Kimono Girl. I told him they are all girls... He said he will just be the first boy!":"我兒子想當舞子。我跟他說舞子都是女孩子……他說那他就當第一個男孩子！","I can already dance as well as an Espeon. Look! ...Okay, maybe as well as a Slowpoke.":"我已經跳得跟太陽伊布一樣好了。你看！……好吧，大概跟呆呆獸差不多。","The Kimono Girls dance with their Pokémon as if they were one. It gives me goosebumps every time!":"舞子們和寶可夢跳起舞來，就像融為一體。每次看都讓我起雞皮疙瘩！","Naoko":"直子","You want to battle on the stage? Then let us dance! Flareon, show them your flames.":"你想在舞台上對戰？那就來跳舞吧！火伊布，讓他們看看你的火焰。","Our dance burned out...":"我們的舞蹈燃盡了……","Flareon's fur is warm, like a little sun.":"火伊布的毛暖暖的，像個小太陽。","Sayo":"小夜","Espeon can sense your next move before you make it. Let us see!":"太陽伊布能在你出招之前就感知到。來試試吧！","It sensed it... and still lost.":"牠感知到了……可還是輸了。","Espeon evolves from an Eevee that loves its Trainer, in the daytime.":"非常親近訓練家的伊布在白天進化，就會變成太陽伊布。","Zuki":"小月","Umbreon shines in the moonlight. Our dance is for the night!":"月亮伊布會在月光下發光。我們的舞蹈屬於夜晚！","The moon went behind a cloud...":"月亮躲到雲後面去了……","Umbreon evolves from an Eevee that loves its Trainer, at night.":"非常親近訓練家的伊布在晚上進化，就會變成月亮伊布。","Kuni":"小邦","Vaporeon's dance flows like water. Can you keep up?":"水伊布的舞姿像流水一樣。你跟得上嗎？","We were washed away...":"我們被沖走了……","A Water Stone turns Eevee into Vaporeon. Simple, but so beautiful.":"用水之石就能讓伊布變成水伊布。很簡單，卻好美麗。","Miki":"美紀","Jolteon dances fast as lightning. Ready for a shock?":"雷伊布的舞步快如閃電。準備好被電了嗎？","Every one of us has a different Eevee evolution. Which one do you like best?":"我們每個人都有不同的伊布進化型。你最喜歡哪一種？","A Pokémon is sleeping here.":"這裡有一隻寶可夢在睡覺。","The path is there, even if you cannot see it. Can you feel it?":"路就在那裡，就算你看不見。你感覺得到嗎？","You felt it...":"你感覺到了……","Keep to the path. One step off it, and you will be back at the door.":"別離開道路。踏錯一步，就會回到門口。","Martha":"瑪莎","The spirits whisper your name... and that you will lose!":"靈魂在低語你的名字……還說你會輸！","The spirits lied to me...":"靈魂騙了我……","Ghost Pokémon cannot be hit by Normal or Fighting moves. Remember that.":"一般和格鬥屬性的招式打不中幽靈寶可夢。記住了。","Jeffrey":"阿傑","In the dark, a Ghost Pokémon is at its strongest!":"在黑暗中，幽靈寶可夢是最強的！","The light found me...":"光明找到我了……","Morty trains here to see what others cannot. Like the path beneath your feet.":"松葉在這裡修行，為了看見別人看不見的東西。就像你腳下的路。","Two Haunters, two curses! Are you scared yet?":"兩隻鬼斯通，兩個詛咒！害怕了嗎？","I am the one who is scared now...":"現在害怕的是我了……","Dark moves and Ghost moves hit Ghost Pokémon hard.":"惡屬性和幽靈屬性的招式對幽靈寶可夢很有效。","So you made it across. Good. I am Morty. Here in Ecruteak, we have trained since long ago to see the legendary Pokémon, and I believe that day is near. Let me see if you have the strength for it!":"你成功走過來了。很好。我是松葉。在圓朱市，我們自古以來就為了見到傳說中的寶可夢而修行，我相信那一天就快到了。讓我看看你有沒有那份力量吧！","I see... You are stronger than I thought.":"原來如此……你比我想像的還要強。","Eusine":"阿桔","Ecruteak City. A city of history, where the past still lives.":"圓朱市。一座歷史悠久、往昔依然鮮活的城市。","The Burned Tower. It burned down in a great fire long ago. Keep out: it is not safe.":"燒焦塔。很久以前在一場大火中燒毀了。危險，請勿進入。","Ecruteak City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Morty, the mystic who sees what is yet to come.":"圓朱市寶可夢道館。館主：松葉，能看見未來的神祕之人。","The Bell Tower. Only those the tower accepts may climb it.":"鈴鐺塔。只有被塔認可的人才能登上。","The Dance Theater. The Kimono Girls dance every day.":"歌舞練場。舞子們每天都在這裡跳舞。","So the Champion of Johto has come. Listen: at night the Bell Tower's bell rings by itself, with no one there to ring it.":"城都的冠軍來了啊。聽我說：到了夜裡，鈴鐺塔的鐘會自己響起來，明明沒有人去敲。","The Sages say the rainbow Pokémon is calling for a Trainer. I think that Trainer is you. Take this: the Clear Bell.":"賢者們說，彩虹色的寶可夢正在呼喚一位訓練家。我想那就是你。收下這個吧：透明鈴鐺。","Show it to the Sage at the Bell Tower. Its ring will open the way.":"拿給鈴鐺塔的賢者看吧。它的鈴聲會為你開路。","Raikou is back! Thunder crackles all around it.":"雷公回來了！牠的周圍雷光劈啪作響。","Raikou is still standing there, watching you.":"雷公還站在那裡，注視著你。","Entei is back! The air shimmers with heat around it.":"炎帝回來了！牠周圍的空氣因高溫而扭曲。","Entei is still standing there, watching you.":"炎帝還站在那裡，注視著你。","The Clear Bell! Its ring is the tower's welcome. Go in: the tower has been waiting for you.":"是透明鈴鐺！它的鈴聲就是塔對你的歡迎。進去吧：塔一直在等你。","Ho-Oh has come back to the Bell Tower! I never thought I would live to see it.":"鳳王回到鈴鐺塔了！我從沒想過這輩子能親眼看到。","There is more to the story. The Brass Tower had a guardian too, a great silver Pokémon. When the tower burned, it flew off to the sea.":"故事還沒完。黃銅塔也有一位守護者，是一隻巨大的銀色寶可夢。塔燒起來的時候，牠飛向了大海。","This feather was found in the ashes, and my family has kept it ever since. Take it: I think it has been waiting for you.":"這根羽毛是在灰燼裡找到的，從那以後一直由我家保管。收下吧：我想它一直在等你。","They say the silver Pokémon sleeps deep under the Whirl Islands, beyond whirlpools no boat can cross.":"據說那隻銀色的寶可夢沉睡在漩渦列島的深處，被船隻無法通過的漩渦擋在後面。","An old sailor in Cianwood knows how to calm them. Go and find him.":"湛藍市有一位老水手知道怎麼讓漩渦平靜下來。去找他吧。","The Silver Wing will lead you to the guardian of the sea, deep under the Whirl Islands.":"銀色之羽會帶你去見大海的守護者，就在漩渦列島的深處。","So you met the guardian of the sea as well. Ho-Oh and Lugia both... the old stories live again.":"原來你連大海的守護者也見到了。鳳王和洛奇亞都……古老的傳說又活過來了。","Kurt of Azalea Town once told me he dreamed of making a ball fit for such Pokémon. Go and tell him what you saw.":"檜皮鎮的鋼鐵曾經跟我說過，他夢想做出配得上這些寶可夢的球。去把你看到的告訴他吧。","I cried a little... okay, a lot. But I will get stronger, and next time I will win!":"我哭了一下下……好吧，哭了很久。不過我會變得更強，下次一定贏你！","Sniff... I am sorry. I always cry when I lose. You won fair and square, so here you go.":"嗚……對不起。我一輸就會哭。你贏得光明正大，這個給你。","{player} received the Plain Badge from Whitney!":"{player}從小茜那裡得到了常規徽章！","With the Plain Badge, Pokémon up to level 35 will listen to you.":"有了常規徽章，35級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話。","And take this too. It is TM45, Attract. If the other Pokémon is of the opposite gender, it may be too smitten to fight!":"這個也給你。是招式學習器45，迷人。如果對手是異性的寶可夢，牠可能會著迷到無法戰鬥哦！","I will train even harder now. And I will try not to cry so much... maybe.":"我會更努力地訓練的。也會試著別那麼愛哭……大概吧。","{player}? Is that you? It is me, Bill! I am home in Goldenrod for a few days to see my family.":"{player}？是你嗎？是我，正輝！我回滿金市住幾天，來看看家人。","You helped me out back in Kanto, so let me return the favour. I have been looking after an Eevee, and I think it would love to travel with you.":"你在關都幫過我，這次讓我來報答你吧。我一直在照顧一隻伊布，我想牠一定很樂意跟你一起旅行。","Will you take Eevee?":"你願意帶走伊布嗎？","Okay. If you change your mind, I will be here.":"好吧。如果你改變主意了，我就在這裡。","Your party is full, so I sent Eevee to your PC. My system at work!":"你的隊伍滿了，所以我把伊布傳送到你的電腦裡了。這就是我的系統！","Eevee can evolve in many different ways. A stone, the time of day, how much it loves you... I wonder which one yours will become?":"伊布有很多種進化方式。石頭、時間、牠有多喜歡你……不知道你的伊布會進化成哪一種呢？","Hello, hello! I am the Name Rater. I judge the names of Pokémon.":"你好你好！我是姓名鑑定師，專門評鑑寶可夢的名字。","Shall I rate the name of one of your Pokémon?":"要我來鑑定一下你的寶可夢的名字嗎？","Come back any time.":"隨時歡迎再來。","Rate which Pokémon?":"鑑定哪隻寶可夢？","{mon}... A splendid name! Its first Trainer chose it with love. I would not dare change it.":"{mon}……真是個好名字！這是牠的第一位訓練家用心取的，我可不敢改。","{mon}... A fine name, but it could be finer. Shall I give it a new one?":"{mon}……名字不錯，但還可以更好。要給牠取個新名字嗎？","{mon} it is! Much better than before.":"就叫{mon}吧！比之前好多了。","Welcome to the Trainer's Market! Everything you need for the road.":"歡迎光臨訓練家市場！旅途所需應有盡有。","Here we have the strongest medicine in Johto.":"我們這裡有城都最有效的藥。","Technical Machines! One disc, and your Pokémon learns a new move.":"招式學習器！只要一張光碟，你的寶可夢就能學會新招式。","Battle items and vitamins! Make your Pokémon stronger, for a battle or for good.":"對戰道具和營養劑！讓你的寶可夢變強，可以只在一場對戰中，也可以是永久的。","The station is closed. A note on the door reads: \"The Magnet Train is not running. We are sorry!\"":"車站關閉著。門上的告示寫著：「磁浮列車暫停運行，非常抱歉！」","Staff only beyond this point.":"前方僅限工作人員進入。","Yo, Champion! Whitney uses Normal types. Fighting moves hit them hard!":"喲，冠軍！小茜用的是一般屬性的寶可夢。格鬥屬性的招式對牠們很有效！","Her Miltank's Rollout gets stronger every turn it keeps rolling. Switching Pokémon stops it, and so does a miss.":"她的大奶罐的滾動每多滾一回合就會更強。替換寶可夢能讓牠停下來，沒打中也會停。","With two Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 30 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 35!":"有兩枚城都徽章，30級以下的寶可夢會聽你的。在這裡贏了，就能提高到35級！","Waaaah! You meanie! I lost! Sob... sob...":"哇啊啊——！你好過分！我輸了！嗚……嗚……","Whitney's Miltank knows Rollout. Once it starts rolling, it just keeps going, faster and faster!":"小茜的大奶罐會滾動。牠一滾起來就停不下來，而且越滾越快！","The Radio Tower plays music all day long. My favourite is the lullaby they play at night.":"廣播塔一整天都在播放音樂。我最喜歡晚上播的那首搖籃曲。","Did you know Bill, the man who made the PC storage system, grew up here? His family still lives in that house.":"你知道嗎？發明電腦寄放系統的正輝就是在這裡長大的。他的家人現在還住在那棟房子裡。","The Department Store has everything! I always end up buying far too much.":"百貨公司裡什麼都有！我每次都會買太多東西。","The Magnet Train runs to Saffron City in Kanto. Right now the power supply has a problem, so it is stopped.":"磁浮列車通往關都的金黃市。現在電力供應出了問題，所以停開了。","With so many Trainers in Goldenrod, this Pokémon Center is busy all day.":"滿金市的訓練家這麼多，這裡的寶可夢中心一整天都很忙。","Welcome to the Goldenrod Department Store! The stairs to the upper floors are on the right.":"歡迎光臨滿金百貨！上樓的樓梯在右邊。","I came to buy one Potion, and now my bag is full. How does that always happen?":"我本來只想買一瓶傷藥，結果包包都裝滿了。怎麼每次都這樣？","A vitamin makes a Pokémon stronger for good. They are expensive, but they work!":"營養劑能讓寶可夢永久變強。雖然很貴，但真的有效！","Welcome to the Radio Tower! I am sorry, but the floors upstairs are for staff only.":"歡迎來到廣播塔！不好意思，樓上只有工作人員才能進去。","Our shows reach every town in Johto. On a clear day, they can even hear us in Kanto!":"我們的節目能傳到城都的每個城鎮。天氣好的時候，連關都都聽得到！","I listen to the Pokémon Talk show every day. The host chats with Professor Oak!":"我每天都聽寶可夢訪談節目。主持人會和大木博士聊天哦！","Welcome to the Bike Shop! ...Oh, you already have a Bicycle from Kanto? Good choice. Take care of it, and it will take care of you.":"歡迎光臨自行車店！……哦，你已經有一輛關都的自行車了？眼光不錯。好好愛惜它，它也會好好幫你。","With a Bicycle you can ride all over Johto. I am saving up my pocket money for one!":"有了自行車，就能騎遍整個城都。我正在存零用錢買一輛！","Welcome! Our flowers come from every corner of Johto.":"歡迎光臨！我們的花來自城都的各個角落。","Have you heard about the strange tree west of Violet City? They say it wiggles when you water it. A tree that moves... how odd!":"你聽說過桔梗市西邊那棵奇怪的樹嗎？據說給它澆水的話，它會扭來扭去。會動的樹……真奇怪！","How is your Eevee doing? I hope you two are getting along.":"你的伊布還好嗎？希望你們相處得不錯。","Bill came home for a few days. He spends the whole time talking to his PC... Some things never change.":"正輝回家住幾天。結果他一直在對著電腦說話……有些事真是一點都沒變。","Pokémon left at the Day Care on Route 34 come back stronger. They grow a little with every step you take!":"寄放在34號道路培育屋的寶可夢回來時都會變強。你每走一步，牠們就會成長一點哦！","Whitney cried when she lost to my big brother. She is really strong, but she is a crybaby!":"小茜輸給我哥哥的時候哭了。她真的很強，可就是個愛哭鬼！","Oh, Whitney is crying again... She always cries when she loses. Talk to her once more, she will cheer up soon.":"唉，小茜又在哭了……她每次輸了都會哭。再跟她說一次話吧，她很快就會好起來的。","Victoria":"維琪","Whitney is so cute. Everyone wants to be like her! Me too!":"小茜好可愛。大家都想變得跟她一樣！我也是！","Not cute enough...":"還是不夠可愛……","Whitney's Miltank gives the best milk. It also hits the hardest.":"小茜的大奶罐擠出的牛奶最好喝。牠打起人來也最痛。","Samantha":"小珊","My Meowth and I will scratch you up!":"我和我的喵喵要把你抓得滿身傷！","My Meowth lost its claws...":"我的喵喵爪子都沒了……","Normal types have no weaknesses... except for Fighting moves.":"一般屬性沒有弱點……除了格鬥屬性的招式。","Snubbull may look tough, but it is really sweet. Unlike me in battle!":"布魯看起來很兇，其實很溫柔。對戰時的我可就不一樣了！","So mean...":"好過分……","When Miltank uses Attract, a Pokémon of the other gender falls for it and forgets to fight.":"大奶罐使出迷人時，異性的寶可夢會被迷住，忘了戰鬥。","Three Jigglypuff, three times the fun!":"三隻胖丁，三倍的快樂！","They all fell asleep...":"牠們全都睡著了……","Whitney's Clefairy can use Encore. Then your Pokémon has to repeat the same move again and again.":"小茜的皮皮會再來一次。這樣你的寶可夢就只能一直重複同一個招式。","Hi! I am Whitney! Everybody was into Pokémon, so I got into them too. They are just so cute! You want to battle? Okay, but I am warning you, I am good!":"嗨！我是小茜！大家都迷上了寶可夢，所以我也迷上啦。牠們實在太可愛了！你想對戰？好呀，不過我先說好，我可是很厲害的！","No way... I lost...":"不會吧……我輸了……","Name Rater":"姓名鑑定師","Goldenrod City. Johto's great city, busy and bright from morning to night.":"滿金市。城都的大城市，從早到晚都熱鬧又明亮。","Goldenrod City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Whitney, the cheerful queen of Normal types!":"滿金市寶可夢道館。館主：小茜，開朗的一般屬性女王！","The Goldenrod Department Store, the biggest shop in Johto, is on the west side of the city.":"城都最大的商店——滿金百貨，就在城市的西邊。","Magnet Train Station. The fastest way to Kanto, once it runs again.":"磁浮列車站。等它恢復運行，就是去關都最快的方式。","Floor guide. 1F: Information. 2F: Trainer's Market. 3F: TMs, battle items and vitamins.":"樓層導覽。1樓：服務台。2樓：訓練家市場。3樓：招式學習器、對戰道具和營養劑。","Oh, you have the Plain Badge! Then you are strong enough to deal with that strange tree on Route 36.":"哦，你拿到常規徽章了！那你應該有本事對付36號道路上那棵奇怪的樹了。","Take this Squirt Bottle. If you water the tree, I bet something will happen!":"這個傑尼龜噴壺給你。要是給那棵樹澆澆水，肯定會發生什麼事！","That strange tree on Route 36... I would water it myself, but only a strong Trainer should go near it. Win a badge from Whitney first!":"36號道路上那棵奇怪的樹……我本想自己去澆水，但只有厲害的訓練家才該靠近它。先從小茜那裡贏一枚徽章吧！","North: Route 35 and the National Park.":"北：35號道路和自然公園。","The radio only plays Team Rocket now. They have taken over the whole Radio Tower!":"現在收音機裡只有火箭隊的聲音。他們佔領了整座廣播塔！","The lullaby is back on the radio at night. Thank you for chasing Team Rocket away!":"晚上收音機裡又播起搖籃曲了。謝謝你趕走了火箭隊！","The Radio Tower belongs to Team Rocket now. Soon all of Johto will hear our call!":"廣播塔現在是火箭隊的了。很快整個城都都會聽到我們的呼喚！","Welcome back! You saved the Radio Tower. Please, look around upstairs as much as you like.":"歡迎回來！是你救了廣播塔。樓上請隨便參觀。","Welcome to Team Rocket Radio! Visitors are not welcome!":"歡迎收聽火箭隊電台！訪客不受歡迎！","You are not a visitor, you are trouble...":"你不是訪客，你是個麻煩……","Our executives are upstairs. You will never get to them!":"我們的幹部在樓上。你絕對到不了那裡！","Welcome to our new counter for held items! Give one to a Pokémon, and it will use it in battle all by itself.":"歡迎光臨新開的攜帶道具櫃台！把道具交給寶可夢拿著，牠在對戰中就會自己使用。","Vance":"凡斯","My Pidgeotto can fly over the mountains. Can yours?":"我的比比鳥能飛越高山。你的呢？","Flying types have it easy on mountain roads. No ice to slip on!":"飛行屬性在山路上可輕鬆了。不會在冰上滑倒！","I foresaw that you would come this way. I did not foresee who would win, though.":"我預見到你會走這條路。不過我沒預見到誰會贏。","Even my future sight was clouded...":"連我的預知能力都蒙上了霧……","The future is never fixed. That is what makes it worth training for.":"未來從來不是注定的。正因如此，訓練才有意義。","Shh! You are scaring the fish. Fine, a battle it is!":"噓！你會把魚嚇跑的。好吧，那就對戰！","Remoraid shoot water like a jet. When they grow up, they latch on to things.":"鐵炮魚會像水槍一樣噴水。長大以後就會吸附在東西上。","Cybil":"西貝爾","Pretty Pokémon can be strong too. Let me show you!":"可愛的寶可夢也能很強。我來證明給你看！","Beaten, but beautifully.":"輸了，但輸得很漂亮。","Clair of Blackthorn is the strongest Gym Leader in Johto. Are you heading her way?":"煙墨市的小椿是城都最強的道館館主。你要去挑戰她嗎？","Zach":"扎克","My Rhyhorn grew a drill on its head! Want to see what it can do?":"我的獨角犀牛頭上長出鑽頭了！想看看牠的厲害嗎？","The drill could not break through...":"鑽頭也鑽不穿……","I would love a Pokémon from the Dragon's Den. Only the dragon clan may go in, though.":"好想要龍穴裡的寶可夢啊。不過只有龍之一族才能進去。","Allen":"艾倫","A Trainer on the way to Blackthorn? Then you must be good. Prove it!":"要去煙墨市的訓練家？那你一定很厲害。證明給我看！","The Ice Path is slippery. Think before every step, or you will slide right past where you wanted to go.":"冰之洞很滑。每走一步前都要想清楚，不然就會滑過頭。","Route 44. West: Mahogany Town. East: the Ice Path.":"44號道路。西：卡吉鎮。東：冰之洞。","The Ice Path. Its floors are frozen solid all year round. Blackthorn City lies on the other side.":"冰之洞。洞裡的地面一年到頭都凍得結結實實。另一頭就是煙墨市。","I teach Headbutt. Knock it into a tree, and sleeping Pokémon come tumbling down!":"我會教頭錘。往樹上一撞，睡在樹上的寶可夢就會滾下來！","Shall I teach Headbutt to one of your Pokémon?":"要我教你的寶可夢頭錘嗎？","Teach which Pokémon?":"教哪隻寶可夢？","That Pokémon cannot learn it. Sorry!":"那隻寶可夢學不會。抱歉啦！","Now try it on a tree. Look for the ones with lighter leaves.":"現在去找棵樹試試吧。找葉子顏色比較淺的那種。","Oh no, oh no... I was cutting wood with our Farfetch'd, and it ran off into the forest!":"糟了糟了……我正和我們的大蔥鴨砍柴，牠卻跑進森林裡去了！","My master will be so angry. If you see a Farfetch'd, could you chase it back this way?":"師傅一定會大發雷霆的。要是你看到了大蔥鴨，能把牠往這邊趕回來嗎？","Kwaa! Farfetch'd hopped away into the trees!":"嘎——！大蔥鴨蹦蹦跳跳地跑進樹叢裡了！","Kwaa! Farfetch'd ran off... back toward the forest entrance!":"嘎——！大蔥鴨跑走了……朝著森林入口的方向！","So this is where my apprentice ran off to... and our Farfetch'd is back, too. You found it for him?":"原來我的徒弟跑到這裡來了……我們的大蔥鴨也回來了。是你幫他找到的嗎？","Thank you, young Trainer. Please, take this. It is the heat of my kiln, packed into a disc.":"謝謝你，年輕的訓練家。請收下這個。這是把我窯裡的火候裝進了光碟。","That is TM35, Flamethrower. Fire moves are tough on bugs and grass, and a strong fire never goes out!":"那是招式學習器35，噴射火焰。火屬性的招式對蟲和草很有效，旺盛的火是永遠不會熄滅的！","Come on, you two. Back to the kiln!":"走吧，你們兩個。回窯裡去！","A small wooden shrine. It honours the guardian of the forest, said to travel through time.":"一座小小的木製祠堂。供奉著森林的守護神，據說牠能穿越時間。","Someone has left fresh berries in front of it.":"有人在祠堂前供上了新鮮的樹果。","Farfetch'd, you are back! I am never letting go of you again. Thank you so much!":"大蔥鴨，你回來啦！我再也不放開你了。真是太謝謝你了！","Farfetch'd is hugging its leek. It looks tired from all that running.":"大蔥鴨緊緊抱著牠的蔥。跑了這麼久，牠看起來累壞了。","Some Pokémon sleep up in the trees. Give a tree a good knock, and one might fall right on your head!":"有些寶可夢睡在樹上。用力撞一撞樹，說不定就有一隻掉到你頭上！","Wayne":"阿偉","This forest is the best place in Johto for bugs. Let me show you mine!":"這片森林是城都最適合蟲寶可夢的地方。讓你看看我的！","My bugs crawled away...":"我的蟲子都爬走了……","Paras like the damp ground by the pond. You can find them there at night.":"派拉斯喜歡池塘邊潮濕的地面。晚上可以在那裡找到牠們。","Apprentice":"徒弟","Charcoal Maker":"燒炭師傅","Ilex Forest. The trees grow so close together that it is dim here even at noon.":"櫟樹林。樹木長得太密，就連正午這裡也很昏暗。","A Level Ball works better the higher your own Pokémon's level is above the wild one's.":"你的寶可夢等級比野生寶可夢高得越多，等級球就越好用。","A Lure Ball is made for Pokémon you hook with a fishing rod.":"誘餌球是專門用來抓用釣竿釣上來的寶可夢的。","A Moon Ball works wonders on Pokémon that evolve with a Moon Stone.":"對用月之石進化的寶可夢，月亮球特別有效。","A Pokémon caught in a Friend Ball takes to you right away.":"用友友球抓到的寶可夢，馬上就會和你親近起來。","A Love Ball works on a Pokémon of the same species as yours, but of the other gender.":"甜蜜球對和你的寶可夢同種類、但性別相反的寶可夢有效。","A Fast Ball is made for catching very fast Pokémon, the kind that always run away.":"速度球是用來抓速度很快、總是一下子就逃掉的寶可夢的。","A Heavy Ball works better the heavier the Pokémon is. On light ones, it is worse than a plain ball.":"寶可夢越重，沉重球就越好用。對輕的寶可夢，它比普通的精靈球還差。","{player}! Look at this: my back is finally better. I can sit at my bench again!":"{player}！你看：我的腰終於好了。我又能坐到工作台前了！","The elder of Ecruteak says you met Ho-Oh and Lugia. When I heard that, my hands began to itch to make Poké Balls again.":"圓朱市的長老說你見到了鳳王和洛奇亞。我一聽，手就癢得想再做精靈球了。","I make them out of Apricorns, a fruit that grows on trees all over Johto. Each colour makes a different kind of ball. Keep them in this.":"我是用球果來做的，那是長在城都各地樹上的果實。不同的顏色能做出不同的球。用這個裝著吧。","A tree bears one Apricorn a day. There is a white one right here in town, a pink one on Route 33, a red and a blue one on Route 37, and a green and a yellow one on Route 42.":"每棵樹一天結一個球果。鎮上就有一棵白色的，33號道路有粉色的，37號道路有紅色和藍色的，42號道路有綠色和黃色的。","The black one is the rarest of all. The only tree I know grows in a hollow deep in the Dark Cave. Its mouth is on Route 31, just east of Violet City.":"黑色的最稀有了。我只知道一棵，長在黑暗洞穴深處的一處窪地裡。洞口在31號道路上，就在桔梗市東邊。","Bring me Apricorns, and I will turn them into balls right here while you wait!":"把球果拿來給我，我當場就把它們做成球，你稍等一下就好！","Bring me Apricorns, and I will make balls out of them. I have not made you a {item} yet!":"把球果拿來給我，我就用它們做球。我還沒給你做過{item}呢！","Bring me Apricorns any time. A Trainer can never have too many good balls!":"隨時把球果拿來給我吧。訓練家的好球是永遠不嫌多的！","Apricorns! Leave them to me...":"是球果啊！交給我吧……","That makes all seven kinds! I have not made a full set like this since I was a young man.":"這樣七種就齊了！這麼完整的一套，我從年輕時起就沒再做過了。","Use them well, and come back whenever you find more Apricorns.":"好好用它們吧。找到更多球果的話，隨時再來。","Oh, and the researchers at the Ruins of Alph sent word: the earthquake opened chambers that were sealed for ages. They are asking for a good Trainer to help.":"對了，阿露福遺跡的研究員捎來了消息：地震讓封閉了不知多少年的石室打開了。他們在找一位厲害的訓練家幫忙。","Two challenges meet at the Indigo Plateau: Kanto's Elite Four, and the Elite Four that Johto's Trainers face, with their own Champion.":"石英高原有兩項挑戰：關都的四天王，以及城都訓練家要面對的四天王和他們的冠軍。","Which challenge will you take?":"你要接受哪一項挑戰？","Kanto's Elite Four":"關都四天王","I have been waiting for you, {player}. The Champion of Kanto, and now the holder of all eight of Johto's badges.":"我一直在等你，{player}。關都的冠軍，如今也集齊了城都的八枚徽章。","For the Trainers of Johto, I am the last one standing in this League: its Champion. We fought together against Team Rocket. Today we fight each other, and I will hold nothing back.":"對城都的訓練家來說，我是這個聯盟的最後一關：冠軍。我們曾一起對抗火箭隊。今天我們要彼此交手，我不會有絲毫保留。","...It is over. You have beaten me once more, and this time as Johto's Champion.":"……結束了。你又一次打敗了我，這次是以城都冠軍的身份。","Your Pokémon fought for you with everything they had. That is a bond no dragon can break.":"你的寶可夢為你拼盡了全力。這是任何龍都無法斬斷的羈絆。","Come with me. Johto's Hall of Fame is waiting for you and your team.":"跟我來。城都的殿堂正等著你和你的隊伍。","So you have come to face me again, Champion. My dragons have grown stronger. Let us see how far you have come!":"你又來挑戰我了，冠軍。我的龍變得更強了。讓我看看你成長了多少！","Still the Champion. I will be waiting for the next time.":"依然是冠軍啊。我會等著下一次的。","Your team's names are written here once already, for Kanto. Today the Hall of Fame remembers them again, as the Champions of Johto.":"你的隊伍的名字已經因關都寫在這裡一次了。今天，殿堂將再次記住牠們，作為城都的冠軍。","Team Rocket is gone, the Gyarados of the lake are calm, and Johto's Pokémon trust you. Go home and rest, Champion. You have earned it.":"火箭隊消失了，湖裡的暴鯉龍也平靜了，城都的寶可夢都信任你。回家好好休息吧，冠軍。這是你應得的。","Losing will not stop me. Go on: the next room holds someone far more cunning than I am.":"輸了也阻止不了我。繼續前進吧：下一個房間裡的人比我狡猾得多。","A ninja knows when he is beaten. Go. The next of us fights with fists, not tricks.":"忍者知道自己何時輸了。去吧。下一位靠的是拳頭，不是計謀。","Go on. Karen is next, and she does not go easy on anyone.":"去吧。下一位是梨花，她對誰都不會手下留情。","The Champion waits beyond this door. You have met him before, I think.":"冠軍就在這扇門後面等著你。我想你們以前見過面。","So you are the one who gathered all of Johto's badges. I am Will. I traveled the world to sharpen my Psychic Pokémon, and I will not lose to anyone now!":"原來你就是集齊了城都所有徽章的人。我是一樹。我走遍世界磨練我的超能力寶可夢，現在我誰都不會輸！","My mind... did not see this coming.":"我的心靈……竟沒能預見到這個結果。","Back again, Champion? My mind has grown sharper since our battle. This time I have foreseen my victory!":"又來了嗎，冠軍？自從上次對戰，我的心靈更加敏銳了。這次我已經預見到自己的勝利！","Fwahahaha! We meet again. I am Koga, master of the ninja arts, and now of the Elite Four. Poison, confusion and patience: no foe escapes my techniques!":"哇哈哈哈！我們又見面了。我是阿桔，忍術大師，如今也是四天王之一。劇毒、混亂與耐心：誰也逃不出我的忍術！","My techniques... seen through once more.":"我的忍術……又一次被看穿了。","You return, Champion. I have refined my poisons since our last battle. Let us see if you can still slip through them!":"你回來了，冠軍。自上次對戰後我又精煉了我的毒。看看你還能不能躲過去！","You again! Champion of Kanto, and now Johto's badges too. My Pokémon and I have trained in Johto's mountains since then. Hoo hah! Show me your strength once more!":"又是你！關都的冠軍，現在連城都的徽章也到手了。從那以後我和我的寶可夢一直在城都的山裡修行。呼哈！再讓我見識一次你的力量吧！","Again... my training still falls short.":"又輸了……我的修行還是不夠。","Champion! I have not missed a single day of training. Hoo hah! This time my fists will reach you!":"冠軍！我一天都沒落下修行。呼哈！這次我的拳頭一定能打中你！","I am Karen of the Elite Four. My favourite? Dark Pokémon: tough, clever and misunderstood. People call some Pokémon strong and others weak, but that is only their opinion. A real Trainer wins with the Pokémon they believe in.":"我是四天王梨花。我最喜歡的？惡屬性寶可夢：堅韌、聰明，又總被誤解。人們說有的寶可夢強、有的弱，那只是他們的看法。真正的訓練家會和自己相信的寶可夢一起贏。","I like your style. You battle with your heart.":"我喜歡你的風格。你是用心在對戰。","Karen":"梨花","You came back, Champion. Good. My Dark Pokémon have been looking forward to this.":"你回來了，冠軍。很好。我的惡屬性寶可夢一直期待著這一刻。","An Electrode is wired into the machine. It is powering the radio signal!":"一隻頑皮雷彈被連在機器上。是牠在為電波信號供電！","The machine fell silent. The radio signal has stopped!":"機器安靜了下來。電波信號停止了！","Your Pokémon look tired. Here, let me help.":"你的寶可夢看起來很累了。來，我幫你一把。","The Electrode in that room are powering the signal. Stop them, and the Gyarados will calm down.":"那個房間裡的頑皮雷彈在為信號供電。只要阻止牠們，暴鯉龍就會平靜下來。","You did it. The signal is gone, and the Gyarados in the lake will calm down.":"你做到了。信號消失了，湖裡的暴鯉龍也會平靜下來的。","You fight well. Take this: HM07, Waterfall. With it, a Pokémon can climb a waterfall.":"你很會戰鬥。收下這個：秘傳學習器07，攀瀑。有了它，寶可夢就能爬上瀑布。","Pryce has opened his Gym again. We will meet again, I am sure of it.":"柳伯重新開放道館了。我們還會再見面的，我很確定。","Team Rocket is not finished yet. Stay on your guard.":"火箭隊還沒有完。要保持警惕。","Welcome... Souvenirs of the Lake of Rage. Buy something, or move along.":"歡迎……憤怒之湖的紀念品。要買就買，不買就走。","The shop is mine again! Those men pushed me out. Thank you, dear. Buy something nice!":"店又是我的了！那些人把我趕了出去。謝謝你，孩子。買點好東西吧！","Ice teaches patience. Winter is hard, but spring always follows. Keep going, young one.":"冰教會人耐心。冬天雖然嚴酷，但春天總會到來。繼續前進吧，年輕人。","A red Gyarados! It is thrashing about in a terrible rage!":"紅色的暴鯉龍！牠正怒不可遏地翻騰著！","Something red is floating on the water...":"水面上漂著某個紅色的東西……","That Gyarados was red... You handled it well.":"那隻暴鯉龍是紅色的……你應對得很好。","I am Lance. I came here because the Gyarados in this lake were forced to evolve. A strange radio signal is coming from Mahogany Town.":"我是阿渡。我來這裡，是因為這個湖裡的暴鯉龍被強行進化了。有一股奇怪的電波從卡吉鎮傳出來。","Team Rocket is behind it, I am sure. Meet me at the souvenir shop in Mahogany.":"我敢肯定是火箭隊在搞鬼。我們在卡吉鎮的紀念品店會合吧。","The clerk was a Team Rocket Grunt. My Dragonite took care of him.":"店員是火箭隊的手下。我的快龍已經收拾他了。","The stairs behind the shelf lead to their hideout. I will go ahead. Follow me!":"架子後面的樓梯通往他們的基地。我先走一步。跟上來！","Behind the shelf... a cold draft comes up from somewhere below. The clerk is watching you.":"架子後面……有一股冷風從下面吹上來。店員正盯著你。","The Gym is locked. A note reads: \"Strange signals have the town on edge. The Gym is closed until further notice. Pryce\"":"道館鎖著。紙條上寫著：「奇怪的信號讓鎮上人心惶惶，道館暫停開放。柳伯」","Fine, fine. You beat me. But the transmitter is powered by our Electrode, and you will never switch them all off!":"好吧好吧，你贏了。不過發射器是由我們的頑皮雷彈供電的，你絕對關不掉全部！","Yo, Champion! Pryce uses Ice types. Fire, Fighting, Rock and Steel moves are what you want.":"喲，冠軍！柳伯用的是冰屬性的寶可夢。用火、格鬥、岩石和鋼屬性的招式就對了。","The floor is ice: you slide until something stops you. Use the rocks to steer!":"地板是冰做的：你會一直滑到撞上東西為止。利用岩石來控制方向吧！","With six Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 60 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 70!":"有六枚城都徽章，60級以下的寶可夢會聽你的。在這裡贏了，就能提高到70級！","Take this. The Glacier Badge.":"收下吧。冰雪徽章。","{player} received the Glacier Badge from Pryce!":"{player}從柳伯那裡得到了冰雪徽章！","With the Glacier Badge, Pokémon up to level 70 will listen to you.":"有了冰雪徽章，70級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話。","And this: TM07, Hail. It brings down a hailstorm that hurts every Pokémon but the Ice types.":"還有這個：招式學習器07，冰雹。它會降下冰雹，傷害冰屬性以外的所有寶可夢。","Have you heard? A red Gyarados was seen at the Lake of Rage, north of town!":"你聽說了嗎？有人在鎮子北邊的憤怒之湖看到了紅色的暴鯉龍！","That souvenir shop is odd. The clerk never smiles, and men in black go in and never come out.":"那家紀念品店很奇怪。店員從來不笑，穿黑衣服的人進去後就再也沒出來過。","The men in black are gone! And Pryce has opened his Gym again.":"穿黑衣服的人都不見了！柳伯也重新開放道館了。","The Gyarados in the Lake of Rage have been angry for days. Something is stirring them up.":"憤怒之湖的暴鯉龍已經暴躁好幾天了。一定有什麼東西在刺激牠們。","Pryce has trained Ice Pokémon for fifty years. He says the cold makes the heart strong.":"柳伯訓練冰屬性寶可夢已經五十年了。他說寒冷能讓人的心變得堅強。","Pryce's Gym floor is all ice. You slide until you hit something! It is so much fun.":"柳伯道館的地板全是冰。你會一直滑到撞上東西為止！超好玩的。","I came to see the red Gyarados, but I will settle for a battle!":"我是來看紅色暴鯉龍的，不過來場對戰也行！","Not even a red Gyarados could save me...":"就算是紅色暴鯉龍也救不了我……","They say the Gyarados in the lake were Magikarp only a week ago.":"聽說湖裡的暴鯉龍一個星期前還是鯉魚王。","Marvin":"阿文","My Magikarp are ready to flop! And my Gyarados is ready to bite!":"我的鯉魚王準備好跳了！我的暴鯉龍準備好咬人了！","Flop...":"啪嗒……","All the Magikarp in the lake turned into Gyarados overnight. It is not natural.":"湖裡所有的鯉魚王一夜之間都變成了暴鯉龍。這太不正常了。","I am camping by the lake to see the red Gyarados. Battle me while I wait!":"我在湖邊露營，等著看紅色暴鯉龍。等的時候陪我對戰吧！","Rolled up and lost...":"縮成一團輸掉了……","At night the lake is so quiet. Then suddenly: splash! A Gyarados!":"晚上的湖好安靜。然後突然——嘩啦！一隻暴鯉龍！","Tiffany":"蒂芙尼","A picnic by the lake! And a battle for dessert!":"在湖邊野餐！再來一場對戰當甜點！","Dessert is over...":"甜點吃完了……","Clefairy love the moonlight over the lake. It is so pretty.":"皮皮最喜歡湖面上的月光了。好美啊。","The lake has been full of angry Gyarados for a week. There is a red one out in the middle!":"這一個星期湖裡全是暴躁的暴鯉龍。湖中間還有一隻紅色的！","I will keep the guards here busy. Go on down the stairs!":"這裡的守衛交給我。你快下樓去！","An intruder! How did you get past the shop?":"有入侵者！你是怎麼通過那家店的？","Ugh, I let you in...":"嗚，居然讓你進來了……","The boss is going to be so mad at me.":"老大一定會大發雷霆的。","Our radio is making all the Magikarp evolve. Isn't it brilliant?":"我們的電波正在讓所有鯉魚王進化。是不是很厲害？","Not so brilliant after all...":"看來也沒那麼厲害……","We were going to sell all those Gyarados. Ruined!":"我們本來打算把那些暴鯉龍全賣掉的。全泡湯了！","Team Rocket is back, and Johto is ours! Get out of here!":"火箭隊回來了，城都是我們的！快滾出去！","Johto is not ours yet...":"城都還不是我們的……","Our executive is downstairs. He will deal with you.":"我們的幹部在樓下。他會收拾你的。","Nobody gets into the machine room without the executive's say-so!":"沒有幹部的允許，誰也不准進機房！","Petrel":"拉姆達","So you are the brat who keeps getting in our way. I am Petrel, an executive of Team Rocket. Our radio signal will not be switched off by a child!":"原來就是你這個小鬼一直在妨礙我們。我是火箭隊幹部拉姆達。我們的電波信號可不會被小孩子關掉！","Hmph. Not bad, kid.":"哼。還不賴嘛，小鬼。","Rosalind":"羅莎琳","You made it across the ice? Then let us see how you do against a Skier!":"你成功滑過冰面了？那就看看你對上滑雪者會怎樣吧！","I slipped...":"我滑倒了……","Pryce never slips on the ice. Not once in fifty years.":"柳伯在冰上從來不會滑倒。五十年來一次都沒有。","Clarissa":"克拉莉莎","The cold makes my Dewgong stronger. Are you freezing yet?":"寒冷讓我的白海獅變得更強。你凍僵了嗎？","I am the one who is frozen...":"凍僵的是我……","Fire, Fighting, Rock and Steel moves melt Ice types.":"火、格鬥、岩石和鋼屬性的招式能融化冰屬性。","I board on the ice every day. Ready to wipe out?":"我每天都在冰上滑板。準備好摔跤了嗎？","Wiped out...":"摔了個四腳朝天……","On ice you keep sliding until something stops you. Use the rocks!":"在冰上會一直滑到撞上東西為止。好好利用岩石吧！","Brad":"布拉德","Swinub dig in the snow for food. And they dig into opponents too!":"小山豬會在雪裡挖東西吃。牠們也會去挖對手！","Buried in the snow...":"被埋在雪裡了……","Pryce's Piloswine is huge. Its tusks can break ice.":"柳伯的長毛豬好巨大。牠的獠牙能打碎冰塊。","Fifty winters I have trained with Ice Pokémon, and every one of them taught me something. I am Pryce. Let us see whether you can endure the cold!":"我與冰屬性寶可夢一同修行了五十個冬天，每一個冬天都教會了我一些東西。我是柳伯。讓我看看你能不能忍受這份寒冷吧！","Hm... You are stronger than the winter wind. A heart like yours will see you through any hardship.":"嗯……你比冬天的寒風還要強。有這樣一顆心，你一定能克服任何困難。","Mahogany Town. Home of the ninja, it is said.":"卡吉鎮。據說是忍者的故鄉。","Mahogany Town Pokémon Gym. Leader: Pryce, the winter master who has trained for fifty years.":"卡吉鎮寶可夢道館。館主：柳伯，修行了五十年的冬之大師。","Route 43. Mahogany Town to the south, the Lake of Rage to the north.":"43號道路。南邊是卡吉鎮，北邊是憤怒之湖。","The Lake of Rage is just ahead. Mind the Gyarados!":"前方就是憤怒之湖。小心暴鯉龍！","The Lake of Rage. They say it was made by a Gyarados in a rage, long ago.":"憤怒之湖。據說是很久以前一隻暴怒的暴鯉龍造成的。","Sorry, the road east is closed. A rockfall buried it, and we are still digging it out.":"抱歉，往東的路封閉了。落石把路埋住了，我們還在挖。","Men in black keep coming by and telling us to stop working. Who are they to give orders?":"老有穿黑衣服的人跑來叫我們別幹了。他們憑什麼發號施令？","East: Route 44, the Ice Path and Blackthorn City.":"東：44號道路、冰之洞、煙墨市。","I will stay in this mountain until I can beat you. Raise that Tyrogue well!":"我會留在這座山裡，直到能打敗你為止。好好培養那隻無畏小子吧！","I have trained here for months... and still I lost. You are the real thing.":"我在這裡修行了好幾個月……結果還是輸了。你是真正的高手。","Take this Pokémon. It is a Tyrogue: it can become a kicker, a puncher or a spinner, depending on how you raise it.":"收下這隻寶可夢吧。這是無畏小子：看你怎麼培養，牠會成為踢腿高手、出拳高手或是旋轉高手。","Tully":"阿杜","This pond is full of Goldeen. And so is my team!":"這個池塘裡全是角金魚。我的隊伍也是！","The big one got away...":"大魚跑掉了……","Fish bite best in the early morning. Remember that.":"清晨的時候魚最容易上鉤。記住了。","Shane":"阿夏","A Nidorina and a Nidorino! Aren't they a perfect pair?":"尼多娜和尼多力諾！是不是完美的一對？","My perfect pair...":"我完美的一對……","A Moon Stone makes them evolve. I have been saving up for one.":"用月之石就能讓牠們進化。我正在存錢買一顆。","Markus":"馬庫斯","I am studying the rocks of Mt. Mortar. My Slowpoke helps by... sitting.":"我在研究擂缽山的岩石。我的呆呆獸負責幫忙……坐著。","My research has been interrupted...":"我的研究被打斷了……","This mountain is hollow inside. Some say it is an old volcano.":"這座山裡面是空的。有人說它是一座古老的火山。","Benjamin":"阿本","Mountains are for climbing, and Trainers are for battling!":"山是用來爬的，訓練家是用來對戰的！","There is a man training alone in the depths of this mountain. He never comes out.":"這座山的深處有個人在獨自修行。他從來不出來。","Kiyo":"阿清","Who dares to disturb my training? I am Kiyo, the Karate King! Show me your strength!":"是誰敢打擾我修行？我是空手道大王阿清！讓我看看你的力量！","Waaargh! I am beaten!":"哇啊啊！我輸了！","Route 42. Ecruteak City to the west, Mahogany Town to the east, through Mt. Mortar.":"42號道路。西邊是圓朱市，穿過擂缽山，東邊是卡吉鎮。","Route 42. Mahogany Town is just to the east.":"42號道路。東邊就是卡吉鎮。","Oh! You must be {player}, the Champion from Kanto! Professor Oak told me all about you. I am Professor Elm.":"哦！你一定就是{player}吧，關都的冠軍！大木博士跟我說了你好多事。我是空木博士。","I study how Pokémon evolve, and how they hatch from Eggs. Johto is full of things to discover!":"我在研究寶可夢怎麼進化，還有牠們怎麼從蛋裡孵出來。城都到處都是值得探索的東西！","One thing you should know: here in Johto, a Pokémon only follows a Trainer it respects. And respect is earned with Johto's Gym badges.":"有件事你得知道：在城都，寶可夢只會聽從牠尊敬的訓練家。而尊敬要靠城都道館的徽章來贏得。","Your Pokémon from Kanto are very strong, so they may ignore your orders until you earn badges here. Each badge makes more of them listen.":"你從關都帶來的寶可夢都很強，所以在你拿到這裡的徽章之前，牠們可能不聽你的指揮。每拿到一枚徽章，就會有更多寶可夢聽你的。","So why not start fresh? I would like you to raise one of my Pokémon. They are in the Poké Balls on the machine.":"那何不從頭開始呢？我想請你培養我的一隻寶可夢。牠們就在機器上的精靈球裡。","Go on, choose one of the three Pokémon on the machine!":"來吧，從機器上的三隻寶可夢裡選一隻吧！","Mr. Pokémon lives north of Cherrygrove City, at the end of Route 30. He said he found something amazing!":"寶可夢爺爺住在吉花市北邊，30號道路的盡頭。他說他發現了很了不起的東西！","{player}! While you were away, someone broke in and stole one of my Pokémon! The police are searching for him.":"{player}！你不在的時候，有人闖進來偷走了我的一隻寶可夢！警察正在找他。","Please, tell the officer everything you saw!":"拜託你，把你看到的都告訴警察吧！","So this is what Mr. Pokémon found... A Pokémon Egg! Nobody knows how Eggs come to be. What a mystery!":"原來寶可夢爺爺發現的是這個……寶可夢的蛋！沒人知道蛋是怎麼來的。真是個謎啊！","Eggs hatch when they are kept warm and on the move. Would you carry it with you? Walk with it, and it should hatch before long.":"蛋要保持溫暖、跟著走動才會孵化。你能帶著牠嗎？帶著牠多走走，應該很快就會孵出來了。","And take these. You will want to catch Johto's Pokémon too.":"還有，這些給你。你一定也想抓城都的寶可夢吧。","The nearest Gym is in Violet City: west through Route 29 to Cherrygrove City, then north and west along Routes 30 and 31.":"最近的道館在桔梗市：往西走29號道路到吉花市，再沿著30號和31號道路往北、往西走。","The Gym in Violet City is waiting. Remember: each badge makes your stronger Pokémon listen a little more.":"桔梗市的道館在等著你。記住：每拿到一枚徽章，你那些強大的寶可夢就會更聽話一點。","Those are Professor Elm's Pokémon. Better ask him first.":"那些是空木博士的寶可夢。還是先問問他吧。","Professor Elm's Pokémon is resting in this Poké Ball.":"這個精靈球裡，空木博士的寶可夢正在休息。","Wonderful! I think it likes you already.":"太好了！我看牠已經喜歡上你了。","{player} received {mon} from Prof. Elm!":"{player}從空木博士那裡得到了{mon}！","Your party was full, so {mon} went to your PC. Use the PC here to swap your team.":"你的隊伍滿了，所以{mon}被送到了你的電腦裡。用這裡的電腦調整隊伍吧。","Now, I have a favour to ask. My friend Mr. Pokémon says he found something amazing. He lives north of Cherrygrove City, on Route 30.":"對了，我想拜託你一件事。我的朋友寶可夢爺爺說他發現了很了不起的東西。他住在吉花市北邊的30號道路上。","Would you go and see what it is? Your new partner will grow strong on the way!":"你能去看看是什麼嗎？你的新夥伴在路上也會變強的！","Police! A Pokémon was stolen from this lab. You there, did you see anything?":"我是警察！這間研究所有寶可夢被偷了。你，有沒有看到什麼？","A red-haired boy battled you with it in Cherrygrove? Did he say his name?":"一個紅頭髮的男孩在吉花市用牠跟你對戰了？他有說他叫什麼名字嗎？","{rival2}, you say? Thank you. We will find him!":"你說他叫{rival2}？謝謝你。我們一定會找到他！","Thank you, {player}. At least the Pokémon is with a Trainer... I hope he treats it well.":"謝謝你，{player}。至少那隻寶可夢跟著一位訓練家……希望他會好好對待牠。","Huh? The Mystery Egg is moving!":"咦？神奇蛋在動！","Travelers between Kanto and Johto often stop here. Your Pokémon look tired. Let them rest a while.":"往來關都和城都的旅人常在這裡歇腳。你的寶可夢看起來累了，讓牠們休息一下吧。","There! Good as new. Safe travels!":"好了！完全恢復了。一路順風！","Your Pokémon look tired. Let me use the lab's machine on them.":"你的寶可夢看起來累了。我用研究所的機器幫牠們恢復一下吧。","All better! Come back any time.":"都恢復好了！隨時再來吧。","...What are you looking at? This is Professor Elm's lab. They say he keeps rare Pokémon in there. ...Get lost.":"……看什麼看？這是空木博士的研究所。聽說他在裡面養著稀有的寶可夢。……走開。","Professor Elm studies how Pokémon evolve. Pokémon from Kanto look a little different to him, I bet!":"空木博士研究寶可夢的進化。我猜在他眼裡，關都的寶可夢有點不一樣吧！","West of town is Route 29. At night, different Pokémon come out in the grass. Hoothoot, for one!":"鎮子西邊是29號道路。到了晚上，草叢裡會出現不一樣的寶可夢。比如咕咕！","My husband forgets to eat when he is working. If you see him, tell him dinner is ready!":"我丈夫一工作起來就忘了吃飯。你要是看到他，跟他說晚飯做好了！","When I grow up, I want to help my dad with his research. Or be a Champion like you!":"我長大以後想幫爸爸做研究。或者像你一樣當冠軍！","In Johto, morning, day and night each have their own Pokémon. Check your grass at every hour!":"在城都，早上、白天和晚上各有不同的寶可夢。每個時段都去草叢看看吧！","Sentret runs around here by day, and Hoothoot comes out at night. Same grass, different Pokémon!":"白天這裡有尾立跑來跑去，晚上就換咕咕出來。同樣的草叢，不同的寶可夢！","Prof. Elm":"空木博士","Officer":"警察","Route 26. North: the Pokémon League. South and then west: Route 27 and New Bark Town in Johto.":"26號道路。北：寶可夢聯盟。往南再往西：27號道路和城都的若葉鎮。","Route 27. West: New Bark Town, the first town of Johto.":"27號道路。西：若葉鎮，城都的第一個城鎮。","New Bark Town. A fresh wind for every new start.":"若葉鎮。為每一個新的開始吹來清新的風。","Research notes: \"Some Pokémon evolve when they come to trust their Trainer...\"":"研究筆記：「有些寶可夢在信任自己的訓練家之後就會進化……」","Route 29. West: Cherrygrove City. East: New Bark Town.":"29號道路。西：吉花市。東：若葉鎮。","{player}! All eight of Johto's badges! I knew you could do it!":"{player}！城都的八枚徽章全到手了！我就知道你能行！","This is for you. It is the Master Ball, the finest Poké Ball there is: it catches any wild Pokémon without fail.":"這個送給你。這是大師球，世界上最好的精靈球：任何野生寶可夢都能百分之百抓到。","Oh, and the officer called. The boy who stole my Pokémon was seen heading for Victory Road. He seems to have changed...":"對了，警察打電話來了。有人看到偷走我寶可夢的那個少年往冠軍之路去了。他好像變了……","The Pokémon League is beyond Victory Road: east across Route 27, then north on Route 26. Good luck, {player}!":"寶可夢聯盟就在冠軍之路的另一頭：先往東穿過27號道路，再沿26號道路往北。祝你好運，{player}！","Victory Road leads to the Pokémon League. Trainers from Johto may only go on once they hold all eight of Johto's badges.":"冠軍之路通往寶可夢聯盟。城都的訓練家要集齊城都的八枚徽章才能通過。","All eight Johto badges! Victory Road is open to you. The Pokémon League waits at the other end.":"城都的八枚徽章！冠軍之路為你開放了。寶可夢聯盟就在另一頭等著你。","A great waterfall pours down from the cliffs. With Waterfall and the Rising Badge, a Pokémon could climb it.":"一道大瀑布從懸崖上傾瀉而下。有了攀瀑和升龍徽章，寶可夢就能爬上去。","There you are, {player}! I heard about the Ruins of Alph. Pokémon shaped like letters... the world is full of mysteries!":"你來了，{player}！我聽說阿露福遺跡的事了。形狀像文字的寶可夢……這個世界真是充滿了謎團！","I have a mystery of my own. Remember the Egg Mr. Pokémon found? Since then, the Day Care on Route 34 has been finding Eggs in its yard!":"我也有一個謎要解。還記得寶可夢爺爺找到的那顆蛋嗎？從那以後，34號道路的培育屋在院子裡發現了好幾顆蛋！","They say an Egg sometimes turns up when two Pokémon there get along. Would you find out for me? Hatch an Egg from the Day Care, and show me what comes out!":"聽說兩隻寶可夢在那裡處得好的話，有時就會出現蛋。你能幫我查個明白嗎？孵一顆培育屋的蛋，讓我看看會孵出什麼！","The Day Care is on Route 34, just south of Goldenrod City. Hatch an Egg from there and bring me the Pokémon!":"培育屋在34號道路，就在滿金市南邊。孵一顆那裡的蛋，把寶可夢帶來給我看！","You hatched an Egg from the Day Care? Let me see...":"你孵出了培育屋的蛋？讓我看看……","A Pokémon at the very first stage of its family, only just born! So Pokémon really do come from Eggs, and parents pass things on to their young.":"是這一族最初階段的寶可夢，才剛出生！原來寶可夢真的是從蛋裡出生的，而且父母會把一些東西傳給孩子。","Thank you, {player}. This is a big step for my research. Keep leaving Pokémon at the Day Care: who knows what will hatch next!":"謝謝你，{player}。這對我的研究是一大進展。繼續把寶可夢寄放在培育屋吧：誰知道下次會孵出什麼呢！","Mr. Pokémon called. He heard about your Egg, and he would like to show you something from his collection. His house is at the end of Route 30.":"寶可夢爺爺打來電話了。他聽說了你那顆蛋的事，想給你看看他收藏的東西。他家在30號道路的盡頭。","That is... the Secret Potion from Cianwood! Please, give it to Amphy.":"那是……湛藍市的秘傳之藥！拜託了，給亮亮吃吧。","{player} gave the Secret Potion to Amphy.":"{player}把秘傳之藥給亮亮吃了。","Pa... Pa-paloo!":"帕……帕帕嚕！","Amphy! Your light is back! Thank you so much. I could not leave it alone, not even for a moment.":"亮亮！你的光回來了！真的太謝謝你了。我一刻也不能離開牠身邊。","I must go back to my Gym now. Come and challenge me there. I will be waiting.":"我現在得回道館了。來道館挑戰我吧。我會等你的。","...This is Amphy. It lights the sea at night, so the ships do not get lost.":"……這是亮亮。牠在夜裡照亮大海，讓船隻不會迷路。","But Amphy fell ill, and its light is fading. I cannot leave its side.":"可是亮亮生病了，牠的光越來越弱。我不能離開牠。","They say the pharmacy in Cianwood City, across the sea, makes a medicine that cures anything. Would you... bring it here for me?":"聽說大海對面的湛藍市藥店，有一種什麼病都能治好的藥。你能……幫我帶來嗎？","Amphy and I will keep the light shining. Please come back to Olivine any time.":"我和亮亮會一直守護這盞燈。歡迎你隨時回淺蔥市來。","The Gym is empty. A sign on the door reads: \"Jasmine is at the Lighthouse, caring for a sick Pokémon.\"":"道館裡沒有人。門上的告示寫著：「阿蜜在燈塔照顧生病的寶可夢。」","Yo, Champion! Jasmine uses Steel types. They resist almost everything: hit them with Fire, Fighting or Ground moves.":"喲，冠軍！阿蜜用的是鋼屬性的寶可夢。牠們幾乎什麼都能抵擋：用火、格鬥或地面屬性的招式攻擊吧。","Her Magnemite are part Electric, so Ground moves are double trouble for them. Her Steelix is huge, but slow.":"她的小磁怪還有電屬性，所以地面屬性的招式對牠們格外有效。她的大鋼蛇很龐大，但動作很慢。","With five Johto badges, Pokémon up to level 50 obey you. Win here, and it goes up to 60!":"有五枚城都徽章，50級以下的寶可夢會聽你的。在這裡贏了，就能提高到60級！","This is the Mineral Badge. You have earned it.":"這是鋼鐵徽章。這是你應得的。","{player} received the Mineral Badge from Jasmine!":"{player}從阿蜜那裡得到了鋼鐵徽章！","With the Mineral Badge, Pokémon up to level 60 will listen to you.":"有了鋼鐵徽章，60級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的話。","And this, too: TM23, Iron Tail. A tail as hard as steel. It may even lower the target's Defence.":"這個也給你：招式學習器23，鐵尾。像鋼鐵一樣堅硬的尾巴，有時還能降低對手的防禦。","The sea west of here leads to Cianwood City. You will need a Pokémon that can Surf.":"從這裡往西的海通往湛藍市。你需要一隻會衝浪的寶可夢。","Jasmine, our Gym Leader, has not left the Lighthouse for days. Her Pokémon up there is sick.":"我們的道館館主阿蜜已經好幾天沒離開燈塔了。她在上面的寶可夢生病了。","The Lighthouse is shining again! Jasmine is back at her Gym.":"燈塔又亮起來了！阿蜜回道館了。","Moomoo Milk from the farm up north is sold at the café. It is delicious!":"咖啡館有賣北邊牧場的哞哞鮮奶。超好喝的！","Cianwood City is across the sea to the west. People say a Pokémon that runs on water was seen there!":"湛藍市在西邊的大海對面。聽說有人在那裡看到了在水面上奔跑的寶可夢！","Steel types resist almost everything. Fire, Fighting and Ground moves get through, though.":"鋼屬性幾乎能抵擋一切。不過火、格鬥和地面屬性的招式還是有效的。","When I was young, I pushed boulders around with Strength to train. They say the Gym in Cianwood is full of rocks like that.":"我年輕的時候，用怪力推大石頭來鍛鍊。聽說湛藍市的道館裡到處都是那種石頭。","Welcome to the Olivine Café! Our Moomoo Milk comes fresh from the farm on Route 39.":"歡迎光臨淺蔥咖啡館！我們的哞哞鮮奶是從39號道路的牧場新鮮送來的。","The Lighthouse has guided ships for a hundred years. Its light is not a lamp: it is a Pokémon that shines.":"燈塔已經為船隻引路一百年了。它的光不是燈，而是一隻會發光的寶可夢。","Jasmine is so kind. She is shy, but when she battles, she is as hard as steel!":"阿蜜好溫柔。她很害羞，但對戰的時候可是像鋼鐵一樣堅強！","My husband is a sailor on the S.S. Aqua. When it is fixed, it will sail to Vermilion City in Kanto.":"我丈夫是S.S.水神號上的水手。等船修好了，就會開往關都的枯葉市。","Huey":"阿休","This Lighthouse is a sailor's best friend. Do not you dare disturb it!":"這座燈塔是水手最好的朋友。不准你來搗亂！","I was only guarding it...":"我只是在守護它而已……","Without the light up top, ships could hit the rocks at night.":"要是頂上沒有光，船隻晚上就可能撞上礁石。","Alfred":"阿弗","Noctowl sees in the dark as well as you see in daylight. Shall we?":"貓頭夜鷹在黑暗中看得跟你白天一樣清楚。開始吧？","I did not see that coming, even so.":"即便如此，我還是沒看出來。","Jasmine is at the very top, with the Pokémon that lights the sea.":"阿蜜在最頂層，陪著照亮大海的寶可夢。","I came to see the light Pokémon, but it is sick... Let us battle to cheer up!":"我是來看那隻會發光的寶可夢的，可牠生病了……來對戰打起精神吧！","Not very cheerful...":"一點都沒打起精神……","Marill's tail floats like a ball. It never sinks in the water.":"瑪力露的尾巴像球一樣會浮起來。牠在水裡從來不會沉下去。","My Kingler's claw can crush rocks! Ready?":"我的巨鉗蟹的鉗子能夾碎岩石！準備好了嗎？","Pinched back...":"反被夾了……","A sick light means a dark sea. Every sailor in Olivine is worried.":"燈光病了，大海就是一片漆黑。淺蔥市的水手都很擔心。","Amphy, the Ampharos, is breathing weakly. The light on its tail has almost gone out.":"電龍亮亮呼吸很微弱。牠尾巴上的光幾乎要熄滅了。","Pa-paloo! Amphy's tail shines brightly over the sea.":"帕帕嚕！亮亮的尾巴在海面上閃閃發光。","Thank you again for saving Amphy. But in here, I am a Gym Leader. I use Steel-type Pokémon. They are hard and cold... but strong. Shall we begin?":"再次謝謝你救了亮亮。不過在這裡，我是道館館主。我用的是鋼屬性寶可夢。牠們又硬又冷……但很強。我們開始吧？","...Well done. You are as strong as steel yourself.":"……你做得很好。你本身就像鋼鐵一樣堅強。","Amphy":"亮亮","Olivine City. A port town that smells of the sea breeze.":"淺蔥市。飄著海風氣息的港口城市。","Olivine Lighthouse. Its light guides the ships at night.":"淺蔥燈塔。它的光在夜裡為船隻引路。","Olivine City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Jasmine, the girl of steel and gentle heart.":"淺蔥市寶可夢道館。館主：阿蜜，鋼鐵般堅強又心地溫柔的女孩。","Olivine Port. The S.S. Aqua is in the dock for repairs. Sailings will resume soon.":"淺蔥港。S.S.水神號正在船塢維修，不久就會恢復航行。","Olivine Port. The S.S. Aqua sails south from here to the Hoenn region.":"淺蔥港。S.S.水神號從這裡向南開往豐緣地區。","Welcome to the National Park! Today we are holding the Bug-Catching Contest.":"歡迎來到自然公園！今天這裡舉辦捕蟲大賽。","Today's contest is over. Come back tomorrow!":"今天的大賽已經結束了。明天再來吧！","You need a Pokémon that can battle to take part.":"要參加的話，需要一隻能戰鬥的寶可夢。","Would you like to take part?":"要參加嗎？","Maybe next time, then!":"那就下次吧！","Only your first Pokémon may come with you: {mon}. The others will wait here.":"只有你隊伍裡的第一隻寶可夢可以參加：{mon}。其他的就在這裡等你吧。","Take these: {ball} ×{n}. You have {s} steps to catch the best Bug Pokémon you can!":"這些給你：{ball}×{n}。你有{s}步的時間，去抓一隻最棒的蟲寶可夢吧！","Ready? Go!":"準備好了嗎？開始！","{mon} is your entry for the contest!":"{mon}就是你參賽的寶可夢了！","You already have {old}. Keep {mon} instead?":"你已經有{old}了。要換成{mon}嗎？","{mon} is your entry now. {old} went back into the grass.":"現在你參賽的是{mon}了。{old}回到草叢裡去了。","{mon} went back into the grass.":"{mon}回到草叢裡去了。","The contest is over! The judges are looking at the Pokémon everyone caught...":"大賽結束！評審們正在查看大家抓到的寶可夢……","Bug Catcher Don":"捕蟲少年 阿東","Camper Ed":"露營男 阿德","Picnicker Cindy":"野餐女 欣蒂","Third place: {name}, with {mon}! {n} points.":"第三名：{name}，參賽寶可夢是{mon}！{n}分。","Second place: {name}, with {mon}! {n} points.":"第二名：{name}，參賽寶可夢是{mon}！{n}分。","And the winner is... {name}, with {mon}! {n} points!":"冠軍是……{name}，參賽寶可夢是{mon}！{n}分！","You did not catch anything this time. Better luck next time!":"這次你什麼都沒抓到。下次加油吧！","Congratulations! You came in place {n}. Here is your prize.":"恭喜！你得了第{n}名。這是你的獎品。","You came in place {n}. Thank you for taking part! Here is a little something.":"你得了第{n}名。謝謝你的參與！這是一點小心意。","And the {mon} you caught is yours to keep!":"你抓到的{mon}就歸你了！","Do you want to end the contest now?":"要現在結束比賽嗎？","Good luck! Catch a big one!":"加油！抓一隻大的吧！","Time is up! The contest is over.":"時間到！大賽結束了。","You have no Sport Balls left! The contest is over for you.":"你的競賽球用完了！你的比賽結束了。","Your Pokémon cannot battle any more. The contest is over for you.":"你的寶可夢已經無法戰鬥了。你的比賽結束了。","I dug a hole to sleep in last night. Now I am wide awake. Battle!":"昨晚我挖了個洞睡覺。現在我精神百倍。對戰吧！","Back into my hole I go...":"我還是回洞裡去吧……","Diglett pop out of the ground anywhere. You never know where.":"地鼠會從地面的任何地方冒出來。你永遠不知道牠會從哪裡出來。","Brooke":"布露克","My Pikachu is full of energy today. Let's see how much!":"我的皮卡丘今天精力充沛。來看看有多充沛吧！","All that energy, gone in a flash...":"那麼多的電力，一下子就沒了……","Pikachu stores electricity in its cheeks. Do not pinch them!":"皮卡丘把電儲存在臉頰裡。可別去捏哦！","Vulpix's tails are so soft. Its fire is not, though!":"六尾的尾巴好柔軟。但牠的火可一點都不溫柔！","My Vulpix's fire went out...":"我的六尾的火熄滅了……","Vulpix grows more tails as it gets older. Six of them!":"六尾長大後尾巴會越來越多。一共六條！","Bryan":"布萊恩","My birds fly faster than the wind. Try and keep up!":"我的鳥比風還快。有本事就跟上吧！","My birds came down to earth...":"我的鳥都落地了……","Pidgey flocks fly over the National Park at dawn. It is a beautiful sight.":"黎明時分，成群的波波會飛過自然公園。景色非常美。","I am training for the Bug-Catching Contest. You can be my practice!":"我在為捕蟲大賽做訓練。就拿你來練練手吧！","I need more practice...":"我還得多練習……","In the contest, a high-level Pokémon with lots of HP left scores best. A rare one too!":"比賽中，等級高、剩餘HP多的寶可夢得分最高。稀有的也一樣！","I come here every day to play with my Pokémon. The grass is so soft!":"我每天都來這裡和寶可夢一起玩。草地好軟啊！","Scyther and Pinsir are the stars of the contest. Catch one, and you are sure to win!":"飛天螳螂和凱羅斯是大賽的明星。抓到一隻的話，肯定能贏！","East of here, Route 36 runs to Violet City. They say a tree on that road moves by itself!":"從這裡往東，36號道路通往桔梗市。聽說那條路上有棵樹會自己動！","Bug Pokémon are easier to catch when they are weak. But a Pokémon with more HP left scores more in the contest!":"蟲寶可夢虛弱的時候比較好抓。不過在大賽裡，剩餘HP越多，得分越高哦！","Route 35. Goldenrod City to the south, the National Park to the north.":"35號道路。南邊是滿金市，北邊是自然公園。","The National Park is just ahead. The Bug-Catching Contest is held there every day!":"前方就是自然公園。那裡每天都會舉辦捕蟲大賽！","The National Park. A place for people and Pokémon to relax. Please keep it clean!":"自然公園。人與寶可夢放鬆身心的地方。請保持清潔！","The fountain is fed by a spring deep under the park.":"噴泉的水來自公園地下深處的泉水。","The Bug-Catching Contest is on! Catch the best Bug Pokémon you can.":"捕蟲大賽進行中！盡量抓一隻最棒的蟲寶可夢吧。","...You. I heard Team Rocket took the Radio Tower. Pathetic, hiding in a crowd like that.":"……是你。聽說火箭隊佔領了廣播塔。成群結隊躲在一起，真可悲。","I lost to a Dragon Trainer called Lance. He said I do not care about my Pokémon. What would he know?":"我輸給了一個叫阿渡的龍使。他說我不在乎自己的寶可夢。他懂什麼？","I will prove I am strong. Starting with you!":"我會證明我很強。就從你開始！","...Why? I keep getting stronger, and still... Never mind. I do not need your pity.":"……為什麼？我明明一直在變強，卻還是……算了。我不需要你的同情。","You came to save me? Thank you! Team Rocket tied me up down here and took over my tower.":"你是來救我的嗎？謝謝你！火箭隊把我綁在這裡，佔領了我的廣播塔。","The impostor upstairs is wearing my clothes. Disgraceful! Listen: the stairs on the third floor are locked with a code. Here it is.":"樓上那個冒牌貨竟然穿著我的衣服。太不像話了！聽好：三樓的樓梯用密碼鎖住了。密碼是這個。","{player} learned the code of the stairs!":"{player}記住了樓梯的密碼！","Their leaders are on the top floors. Please, take my tower back!":"他們的頭目在最上面幾層。拜託了，把我的廣播塔奪回來！","Our radio is back on the air, all thanks to you. Tune in any time!":"多虧了你，我們的電台恢復播放了。歡迎隨時收聽！","You did it! Team Rocket is gone, and the Radio Tower is ours again. Thank you!":"你成功了！火箭隊走了，廣播塔又回到我們手裡了。謝謝你！","Please, take this. A radio tower runs on electricity, so this seems fitting: TM24, Thunderbolt.":"請收下這個。廣播塔靠電力運作，所以這個最合適：招式學習器24，十萬伏特。","We could not even do this much in Giovanni's absence... Team Rocket is finished. I declare it disbanded!":"坂木大人不在，我們連這點事都辦不到……火箭隊完了。我宣布火箭隊解散！","Herbs! Bitter, but they work. Well... I sell potions too.":"草藥！雖然苦，但是有效。呃……我也賣傷藥啦。","Your radio crackles... and a voice breaks in:":"你的收音機發出沙沙聲……一個聲音插了進來：","\"Attention, Johto! This is Team Rocket! We have taken over the Radio Tower in Goldenrod City!\"":"「城都的各位請注意！這裡是火箭隊！我們已經佔領了滿金市的廣播塔！」","\"Giovanni! Wherever you are, if you can hear us, come back! Team Rocket is waiting for you!\"":"「坂木大人！無論您在哪裡，如果聽得到，請回來吧！火箭隊在等著您！」","The broadcast ends in a burst of static.":"廣播在一陣雜音中結束了。","The stairs are blocked by a locked door. It needs a code to open.":"樓梯被一扇上鎖的門擋住了。需要密碼才能打開。","Fine, take it! The real Director is locked in the warehouse under the Underground. Not that it matters!":"好吧，拿去！真正的台長被關在地下通道下面的倉庫裡。反正也無所謂了！","The door to the warehouse is locked. It needs a key.":"倉庫的門鎖著。需要鑰匙才能打開。","This is the music studio. Thanks to you, we are back on the air!":"這裡是音樂錄音室。多虧了你，我們又能播放了！","This studio is ours! From now on, the radio plays only Team Rocket!":"這個錄音室是我們的了！從現在起，電台只播火箭隊！","Off the air...":"停播了……","The Director is on the floor above. He works for us now. Ha!":"台長在樓上。他現在為我們工作了。哈！","You again? How many times do we have to tell you to go away?":"又是你？到底要我們說幾次你才肯走？","Many more times, it seems...":"看來還要說很多次……","When Giovanni hears our broadcast, he will come back to lead us!":"等坂木大人聽到我們的廣播，他就會回來領導我們！","The Pokémon Talk show is recorded on this floor. Our guest today is Professor Oak!":"寶可夢訪談節目就在這一層錄製。今天的嘉賓是大木博士！","Nobody gets near the Director! He is very busy... being our Director.":"誰也不准靠近台長！他很忙……忙著當我們的台長。","Okay, you can get near him...":"好吧，你可以靠近他了……","The Director up there is a little odd today. Don't ask why.":"樓上的台長今天有點怪。別問為什麼。","Ah, a visitor! I am the Director of the Radio Tower... Ha! Fooled you! It is me, Petrel, in disguise! The real Director is locked away!":"啊，有客人！我是廣播塔的台長……哈！被騙了吧！是我，喬裝的拉姆達！真正的台長被關起來了！","Gah! My disguise did not help at all!":"啊！我的喬裝一點用都沒有！","I host the Lucky Number show. Today's lucky number is... the number of Rockets you beat!":"我主持幸運號碼節目。今天的幸運號碼就是……你打敗的火箭隊人數！","Our executive is right behind me. You will not get past!":"我們的幹部就在我身後。你別想過去！","You got past...":"被你過去了……","Ariana is the toughest of us. Well, almost.":"雅典娜是我們之中最厲害的。呃，差不多吧。","Ariana":"雅典娜","So you are the child who keeps ruining our plans. I am Ariana, an executive of Team Rocket. You will regret coming here!":"原來你就是一直破壞我們計畫的小孩。我是火箭隊幹部雅典娜。你會後悔來這裡的！","How... how could I lose to you?":"怎麼……我怎麼會輸給你？","Archer is waiting at the top. He will not be as kind as I was.":"阿波羅在最上面等著。他可不會像我這麼手下留情。","Archer":"阿波羅","You have come this far... I am Archer. While Giovanni is away, I lead Team Rocket. We will call him back, and you will not stop us!":"你竟然來到了這裡……我是阿波羅。坂木大人不在的時候，由我來帶領火箭隊。我們一定會讓他回來，你阻止不了我們！","I... lost. Forgive me, Giovanni.":"我……輸了。坂木大人，請原諒我。","The Underground runs beneath the whole city. There are shops down there, and a warehouse at the far end.":"地下通道貫穿整座城市。下面有商店，最裡面還有一個倉庫。","That door at the end leads to a warehouse. It has been locked since men in black moved in.":"盡頭那扇門通往倉庫。自從穿黑衣服的人搬進去後就一直鎖著。","This tunnel is closed! Team Rocket business!":"這條通道封閉了！火箭隊辦事！","Closed for... repairs.":"封閉……維修中。","You need a key for the warehouse anyway. And only our executive has it.":"反正進倉庫需要鑰匙，而且只有我們的幹部才有。","I will wait here until the tower is safe. Please, hurry!":"我會在這裡等到廣播塔安全為止。拜託你快一點！","How did you get the key? Did that fool Petrel lose it?":"你怎麼拿到鑰匙的？是拉姆達那個笨蛋弄丟的嗎？","He definitely lost it...":"他肯定是弄丟了……","We were storing all the stolen things down here.":"我們把偷來的東西都藏在這下面。","The Director stays here until Giovanni comes back! Go away!":"坂木大人回來之前，台長都得待在這裡！快走開！","Giovanni is not coming back, is he...":"坂木大人不會回來了，對吧……","Fine, talk to the old man. See if I care.":"好吧，去跟那老頭說話吧。我才不在乎。","Director":"台長","South of here is Union Cave. On the other side is Azalea Town, where Slowpoke laze around everywhere.":"往南是互連洞。穿過去就是檜皮鎮，那裡到處都是懶洋洋的呆呆獸。","Albert":"阿博","I caught my Zubat in the cave down south. Want to see how strong it got?":"我的超音蝠是在南邊的洞穴裡抓到的。想看看牠變得多強了嗎？","Zubat, come back! You were too fast for us...":"超音蝠，回來！你太快了，我們跟不上……","Union Cave is dark and full of Zubat. Keep a Repel handy.":"互連洞又黑又滿是超音蝠。隨身帶著除蟲噴霧吧。","Ralph":"阿夫","Shh! You will scare the fish. ...Fine, then we battle!":"噓！你會把魚嚇跑的。……好吧，那就來對戰！","My line snapped...":"我的魚線斷了……","The best fishing is early in the morning. Or late at night. Or any time, really!":"釣魚最好是在清晨。或者深夜。其實什麼時候都行！","A picnic and a battle: my favourite kind of day!":"野餐加對戰：我最喜歡這樣的日子了！","Oh well. Back to my sandwiches.":"算了，回去吃我的三明治吧。","Nidoran love the grass on this route.":"尼多蘭和尼多朗都很喜歡這條道路上的草叢。","Henry":"阿亨","I fish all day and battle all night. Here we go!":"我白天釣魚，晚上對戰。來吧！","Reeled in and released...":"釣上來又被放走了……","Poliwag swim up the streams from the sea.":"蚊香蝌蚪會從海裡沿著小溪游上來。","I have been camping out here for a week. Let us battle!":"我已經在這裡露營一個星期了。來對戰吧！","Time to pack up my tent...":"該收帳篷了……","I sleep under the stars every night. The Hoothoot keep me company.":"我每晚都睡在星空下，有咕咕陪著我。","Peter":"小彼","My birds will fly circles around you!":"我的鳥會繞著你飛得團團轉！","Every bird lover in Johto dreams of training at Falkner's Gym.":"城都所有喜歡鳥的人，都夢想著在阿速的道館修行。","Union Cave goes right under the hills. Come out the other side and you are on Route 33.":"互連洞就在山丘下面穿過。從另一邊出來就是33號道路。","Daniel":"阿丹","This cave is my second home. My Onix knows every tunnel!":"這個洞穴是我的第二個家。我的大岩蛇認得每一條隧道！","My Onix got lost...":"我的大岩蛇迷路了……","Union Cave links Route 32 with Route 33. Azalea Town is just beyond.":"互連洞連接著32號道路和33號道路。再過去就是檜皮鎮。","Larry":"阿里","Have you heard? In Azalea, people love Slowpoke more than anything. Mine is the best one!":"你聽說了嗎？檜皮鎮的人最愛呆呆獸了。我的呆呆獸是最棒的！","Slowpoke... you were too slow.":"呆呆獸……你太慢了。","They say a yawning Slowpoke brings rain to Azalea Town.":"據說呆呆獸打個哈欠，檜皮鎮就會下雨。","Russell":"阿素","Rock Pokémon are like family. Meet the family!":"岩石寶可夢就像我的家人。來見見我的家人吧！","The whole family, beaten...":"全家都被打敗了……","Geodude look just like rocks. Watch your step in here!":"小拳石看起來就像石頭。在這裡走路要小心！","Hiking builds strong legs, and strong Pokémon! Battle me!":"爬山能練出強壯的雙腿，還有強壯的寶可夢！跟我對戰吧！","My legs are tired...":"我的腿好累……","Azalea Town is just west of here. It is full of Slowpoke!":"檜皮鎮就在這裡的西邊。那裡到處都是呆呆獸！","Route 32. North: Violet City. South: Union Cave.":"32號道路。北：桔梗市。南：互連洞。","Union Cave. Through it lie Route 33 and Azalea Town.":"互連洞。穿過去就是33號道路和檜皮鎮。","Route 33. West: Azalea Town. East: Union Cave.":"33號道路。西：檜皮鎮。東：互連洞。","Oh, you only have one Pokémon with you. You will need it on the road!":"哎呀，你身邊只有一隻寶可夢。路上你還需要牠呢！","Leave which Pokémon?":"要寄放哪隻寶可夢？","If you leave that one, you will have no Pokémon able to battle!":"如果把牠留下，你就沒有能戰鬥的寶可夢了！","We will raise your {mon} for a while. Come back for it later.":"我們會幫你照顧{mon}一段時間。之後再來接牠吧。","Lv. {lvl}":"Lv.{lvl}","Which one would you like back?":"你要領回哪一隻？","Your {mon} has grown a lot. It went up by {n} levels!":"你的{mon}成長了很多。等級提升了{n}級！","Your {mon}? It has not grown much yet.":"你的{mon}嗎？牠還沒怎麼成長呢。","You owe us ₽{price}. Take it back?":"一共是₽{price}。要領回去嗎？","You have no room for it in your party.":"你的隊伍裡沒有空位了。","{player} took back {mon}.":"{player}領回了{mon}。","Come again!":"歡迎再來！","Hello, dear. My husband and I run the Day Care. We can raise your Pokémon for you.":"你好呀，孩子。我和老伴開了這家培育屋，可以幫你照顧寶可夢哦。","Leave one":"寄放","Take one back":"領回","My wife and I raise Pokémon in our yard. Talk to her inside if you want us to look after one.":"我和老伴在院子裡養寶可夢。想讓我們照顧的話，就進屋去跟她說吧。","Your {mon} is doing fine. It has been running all over the yard.":"你的{mon}很好哦。牠在院子裡到處跑來跑去呢。","Samuel":"阿森","I have been training on this road all day. Battle me!":"我在這條路上練了一整天了。來跟我對戰吧！","All that training for nothing...":"練了這麼久都白費了……","Goldenrod City is the biggest city in Johto. You could get lost in there!":"滿金市是城都最大的城市。在那裡可是會迷路的！","Ian":"伊恩","My Pokémon are fast and fierce. Ready?":"我的寶可夢又快又兇猛。準備好了嗎？","Not fast enough...":"還是不夠快……","I want to beat Whitney one day. Everyone says her Miltank is a monster.":"總有一天我要打敗小茜。大家都說她的大奶罐是個怪物。","Gina":"吉娜","A picnic is more fun with a battle! Come on!":"野餐加上對戰才更好玩！來吧！","My picnic blew away...":"我的野餐被風吹走了……","Hoppip float away on the wind if they do not hold on tight to something.":"毽子草如果不緊緊抓住什麼東西，就會被風吹跑。","Todd":"阿托","Camping on Route 34 is great. Battling on Route 34 is even better!":"在34號道路露營很棒。在34號道路對戰更棒！","I should go back to my tent...":"我還是回帳篷去吧……","Psyduck always has a headache. Maybe that is why it is so grumpy.":"可達鴨總是頭痛。也許這就是牠脾氣這麼差的原因吧。","My Snubbull is the cutest in all of Johto! Look how cute it is when it battles!":"我的布魯是全城都最可愛的！看牠對戰的樣子多可愛！","Even when it loses, it is so cute...":"就算輸了，牠還是好可愛……","Snubbull looks scary, but it is really a big softy. Just like me!":"布魯看起來很兇，其實心腸可軟了。就跟我一樣！","Grandma and Grandpa raise Pokémon for Trainers. When they come back, they are much stronger!":"爺爺奶奶幫訓練家照顧寶可夢。寶可夢回來的時候都變強了好多！","Route 34. Ilex Forest to the south, Goldenrod City to the north.":"34號道路。南邊是櫟樹林，北邊是滿金市。","Route 34. Goldenrod City is just ahead.":"34號道路。前方就是滿金市。","The Day Care. Let us raise your Pokémon for you!":"培育屋。讓我們幫你培育寶可夢吧！","The two of them seem to get along very well.":"那兩隻看起來相處得非常好。","The two of them seem to get along.":"那兩隻看起來相處得還不錯。","The two of them do not seem to like each other very much.":"那兩隻好像不太合得來。","The two of them would rather play with other Pokémon.":"那兩隻比較想和別的寶可夢玩。","Ah, a Trainer! Something odd happened: a few days ago we found an Egg in our yard, and nobody has come for it.":"啊，是訓練家！發生了一件怪事：前幾天我們在院子裡撿到一顆蛋，一直沒人來領。","Oh, but you are carrying six Eggs already! Hatch a few first, then come back.":"哎呀，你已經帶著六顆蛋了！先孵出幾顆再來吧。","Would you look after it? Keep it with you as you travel, and it will hatch.":"你能幫忙照顧它嗎？旅行時一直帶在身邊，它就會孵化。","{player} received the Odd Egg!":"{player}得到了奇異的蛋！","If you leave two Pokémon that get along with my wife, they may leave an Egg of their own. Come and ask me now and then!":"如果你把兩隻合得來的寶可夢交給我老伴照顧，牠們說不定也會留下一顆蛋。時不時來問問我吧！","Ah, there you are! We were looking after your Pokémon, and, my goodness, we found an Egg! Your Pokémon must have left it.":"啊，你來啦！我們照顧你的寶可夢的時候，哎呀，發現了一顆蛋！一定是你的寶可夢留下的。","Do you want the Egg?":"你要這顆蛋嗎？","Then I will keep it for you for now.":"那我就先幫你保管著吧。","{player} received the Egg!":"{player}得到了蛋！","Keep it with you as you travel, and it will hatch.":"旅行時一直帶在身邊，它就會孵化。","A strange tree blocks the way. Water it with the Squirt Bottle?":"一棵奇怪的樹擋住了去路。要用傑尼龜噴壺給它澆水嗎？","{player} watered the strange tree with the Squirt Bottle.":"{player}用傑尼龜噴壺給奇怪的樹澆了水。","The tree did not like that at all! It shook itself and attacked!":"那棵樹一點都不喜歡這樣！它抖了抖身體，撲了過來！","A strange tree blocks the way. When you touch it, it shivers... Is it really a tree?":"一棵奇怪的樹擋住了去路。一碰它，它就抖了一下……這真的是樹嗎？","That tree up there... I am sure it moved when I looked away! And it is not even windy.":"上面那棵樹……我剛一轉頭，它肯定動了！明明一點風都沒有。","So the tree was a Pokémon all along! Sudowoodo hate water, I heard. Strange, for a tree.":"原來那棵樹是寶可夢啊！聽說樹才怪討厭水。作為一棵樹還真奇怪。","I already know how this battle ends. Shall we find out if I am right?":"我早就知道這場對戰的結局了。來看看我說得對不對吧？","I did not see that coming...":"這我可沒預料到……","Psychic Pokémon read minds. Dark and Ghost moves are what they fear.":"超能力寶可夢能讀懂人心。牠們害怕的是惡屬性和幽靈屬性的招式。","Alan":"阿倫","Tangela is a mystery! Nobody has ever seen what is under all those vines. Battle!":"蔓藤怪是個謎！從來沒人見過那堆藤蔓下面是什麼。對戰吧！","Still a mystery...":"還是個謎……","I like Pokémon that are hard to understand. Like that walking tree!":"我喜歡讓人捉摸不透的寶可夢。比如那棵會走路的樹！","Drowzee eats dreams. I wonder what yours taste like?":"催眠貘會吃掉夢。不知道你的夢是什麼味道？","A bad dream...":"一場噩夢……","Ecruteak has two towers. One burned down long ago, and the other still stands.":"圓朱市有兩座塔。一座很久以前燒毀了，另一座至今仍然矗立著。","Clefairy and Jigglypuff are best friends. Just like me and my sister!":"皮皮和胖丁是最好的朋友。就像我和我妹妹一樣！","We lost together...":"我們一起輸了……","My sister is in Ecruteak watching the Kimono Girls dance. I want to go too!":"我妹妹在圓朱市看舞子跳舞。我也想去！","Route 36. North: Route 37 and Ecruteak City.":"36號道路。北：37號道路和圓朱市。","The National Park is to the west.":"西邊是自然公園。","Violet City is to the east.":"東邊是桔梗市。","Ruins of Alph. Closed while the scientists study the ruins. Thank you for understanding.":"阿露福遺跡。學者們正在研究遺跡，暫停開放。感謝理解。","Route 37. Ecruteak City is just to the north.":"37號道路。北邊就是圓朱市。","Sorry, the Ruins of Alph are closed. Since the last earthquake, we have been making sure the chambers are safe.":"抱歉，阿露福遺跡暫不開放。上次地震以後，我們一直在確認石室是否安全。","The Miltank looks weak. A healing Berry might give it its strength back.":"大奶罐看起來很虛弱。也許能回復體力的樹果可以讓牠恢復精神。","The Miltank looks weak. Give it an {item}?":"大奶罐看起來很虛弱。要餵牠{item}嗎？","The Miltank ate the {item}. It looks a little better... and it wants more.":"大奶罐吃掉了{item}。看起來好一點了……牠還想再吃。","The Miltank ate the {item}... Moooo! It jumped to its feet, full of energy!":"大奶罐吃掉了{item}……哞——！牠一下子站了起來，精神百倍！","Our Miltank in the barn is sick. When a Miltank is weak, it needs lots of healing Berries.":"我們牛棚裡的大奶罐生病了。大奶罐虛弱的時候，需要吃很多能回復體力的樹果。","Berry trees grow along the roads around here. Would you help us out?":"附近的路邊長著樹果樹。你願意幫幫我們嗎？","You fed our Miltank back to health! Thank you, young one. Take this as our thanks.":"你餵好了我們的大奶罐！謝謝你，年輕人。這個就當作謝禮吧。","That is TM44, Rest. The Pokémon sleeps and wakes up healed. Just like our Miltank, eh?":"那是招式學習器44，睡覺。寶可夢睡一覺醒來就恢復了。就跟我們的大奶罐一樣，對吧？","Our Moomoo Milk is the best in Johto. Want some?":"我們的哞哞鮮奶是城都最好喝的。要來一點嗎？","Toby":"阿托比","My Doduo have two heads, so they think twice as fast. Battle!":"我的嘟嘟有兩個頭，所以想事情快一倍。對戰吧！","Both heads lost...":"兩個頭都輸了……","Dodrio has three heads now. It argues with itself all day.":"嘟嘟利現在有三個頭。牠整天都在跟自己吵架。","I was on my way to buy Moomoo Milk. A battle first!":"我正要去買哞哞鮮奶。先來對戰一場！","I think I need some milk now...":"我現在需要喝點牛奶了……","Moomoo Milk is the best drink for tired Pokémon. Everyone in Olivine buys it.":"哞哞鮮奶是給疲憊的寶可夢喝的最佳飲品。淺蔥市的人都買它。","Mr. Mime can build invisible walls. Can you break through?":"魔牆人偶能築起看不見的牆。你能突破嗎？","The wall broke...":"牆被打破了……","Mr. Mime's walls are made of the air itself. I still do not understand how.":"魔牆人偶的牆是用空氣做的。我到現在還搞不懂是怎麼做到的。","Harry":"阿哈","I am on shore leave, but a sailor never stops battling!":"我正在上岸休假，但水手可是從不停止對戰的！","Sunk on dry land...":"在陸地上沉沒了……","My ship is docked in Olivine. The sea air there is the best.":"我的船停靠在淺蔥市。那裡的海風最舒服了。","Moo! The Miltank is chewing grass happily.":"哞！大奶罐正開心地嚼著草。","Moooo!":"哞——！","The Miltank looks at you sleepily.":"大奶罐睡眼惺忪地看著你。","Derek":"阿德瑞","Look at my Pikachu's little cheeks! Aren't they the cutest?":"看看我的皮卡丘的小臉頰！是不是可愛極了？","Even losing, it is so cute...":"就算輸了也好可愛……","I came all the way here to show my Pikachu to the Miltank. They did not care.":"我特地跑來給大奶罐看我的皮卡丘。牠們一點興趣都沒有。","Eugene":"阿尤金","Ahoy! A sailor's Pokémon are tough as old rope!":"喂！水手的寶可夢可是像老纜繩一樣結實！","My rope snapped...":"我的纜繩斷了……","At Olivine harbour, the ships come and go all day long.":"淺蔥市的港口裡，船隻整天來來往往。","My Slowpoke is thinking very hard. About what, nobody knows.":"我的呆呆獸正在認真思考。至於想什麼，誰也不知道。","Still thinking...":"還在想……","A Slowpoke bitten by a Shellder becomes a Slowbro. Lucky, or unlucky?":"呆呆獸被大舌貝咬住就會變成呆殼獸。這算幸運還是不幸呢？","Our Miltank give the richest milk in Johto. When one of them is sick, the whole farm worries.":"我們的大奶罐產的牛奶是城都最濃的。只要有一隻生病，整個牧場都會擔心。","Moo! The Miltank is full of energy again.":"哞！大奶罐又恢復了活力。","Our Miltank is sick and will not eat its grass. Grandpa says healing Berries would help, lots of them.":"我們的大奶罐生病了，連草都不吃。爺爺說要餵很多能回復體力的樹果才行。","Look how well our Miltank is doing! Thank you for feeding it all those Berries.":"看我們的大奶罐多精神！謝謝你餵了牠那麼多樹果。","Farmer":"牧場主人","Route 38. Ecruteak City is to the east.":"38號道路。東邊是圓朱市。","Route 38. Route 39 and Olivine City are to the south.":"38號道路。南邊是39號道路和淺蔥市。","Route 39. Olivine City is to the south.":"39號道路。南邊是淺蔥市。","Moomoo Farm. Enjoy our fresh Moomoo Milk!":"哞哞牧場。歡迎品嚐新鮮的哞哞鮮奶！","These mountains are my training ground. Every rock here knows my name!":"這片山就是我的訓練場。這裡的每塊石頭都認識我！","Rocks do not lie. You are strong.":"石頭不會說謊。你很強。","Going down is easy. Coming back up those ledges is another story.":"下山容易。想從那些台階爬回去可就難了。","Quentin":"昆汀","I camped out here all week, waiting for a real Trainer to come down the mountain!":"我在這裡露營了一整個星期，就為了等一個真正的訓練家下山！","Worth the wait...":"等得值了……","At night the mountain is so quiet you can hear the Pokémon breathing.":"晚上山裡安靜得能聽見寶可夢的呼吸聲。","Kelly":"凱莉","Coming from Blackthorn? Then you beat Clair. I want to see that for myself!":"你是從煙墨市來的？那你打敗了小椿。我要親眼看看！","So it is true...":"原來是真的……","The Pokémon League is next for you, I suppose. I will cheer for you!":"接下來你要去寶可夢聯盟了吧。我會為你加油的！","Kenji":"健二","I train by running up and down this road. Hyah! You will be my rest stop!":"我每天沿著這條路跑上跑下來訓練。嘿呀！你就是我的休息站！","I need more laps...":"我得再多跑幾趟……","My Machoke carries boulders up the mountain. That is our warm-up.":"我的豪力會把石頭扛上山。這只是我們的熱身。","Michael":"邁克爾","Rock Pokémon are as tough as the mountain. Can you crack them?":"岩石屬性的寶可夢和山一樣堅硬。你敲得開嗎？","Cracked...":"被敲開了……","Golem sheds its shell once a year. The old shells make great walls.":"隆隆岩每年蛻一次殼。舊殼拿來當牆再好不過了。","Ryan":"瑞安","Almost at the bottom! One more battle to keep you warm.":"快到山腳了！再來一場對戰暖暖身子吧。","Warmed up, all right.":"身子確實暖和了。","Route 46 is just below. From there it is a short walk to New Bark Town.":"下面就是46號道路。從那裡走一小段就到若葉鎮了。","Bailey":"貝利","Whoa, careful on those ledges! Now that you are down, how about a battle?":"哇，小心那些台階！既然你下來了，來對戰吧？","I took a tumble...":"我摔了一跤……","Dark Cave is somewhere around here. I keep getting lost in it.":"黑暗洞穴就在這附近。我老是在裡面迷路。","Erin":"艾琳","I am having a picnic. Battles go great with lunch!":"我在野餐。對戰配午餐最棒了！","My lunch went cold...":"我的午餐都涼了……","New Bark Town is just south and east. The wind there smells like the sea.":"若葉鎮就在東南邊不遠。那裡的風有大海的味道。","Route 45. A mountain road. Watch your step: the ledges only go down.":"45號道路。山路。注意腳下：台階只能往下跳。","Route 45. North: Blackthorn City. South: Route 46.":"45號道路。北：煙墨市。南：46號道路。","Route 46. North: Route 45 and Blackthorn City. South: Route 29.":"46號道路。北：45號道路、煙墨市。南：29號道路。","The panel has slid aside. Stone steps lead down into the dark.":"石板已經移到一旁。石階一路向下，通往黑暗之中。","A stone panel, cut into square pieces that are all out of place. Something is carved on it...":"這是一塊石板，被切成了一塊塊方形的碎片，全都錯了位。上面好像刻著什麼……","Put the pieces back together?":"要把碎片拼回去嗎？","The last piece clicks into place: a carving of {mon}! With a deep rumble, the panel slides aside.":"最後一塊碎片喀噠一聲嵌好了：是{mon}的浮雕！隨著一陣低沉的轟響，石板移到了一旁。","Something was set in the rock behind it. {player} found {item}!":"後面的岩石裡嵌著什麼東西。{player}找到了{item}！","Stone steps lead down into the dark.":"石階一路向下，通往黑暗之中。","Welcome to the Research Center! The last earthquake shook the ruins, and four chambers that had been sealed for ages opened.":"歡迎來到研究所！上次地震搖動了遺跡，四間封閉了不知多少年的石室打開了。","In each one there is a stone panel, cut into pieces that are all out of place. We have tried for weeks, and none of us can put them back together.":"每間石室裡都有一塊石板，被切成碎片，全都錯了位。我們試了好幾個星期，誰也沒能把它們拼回去。","Maybe a Trainer with fresh eyes could. The nearest chamber is just to the west. Will you try?":"也許換個新眼光的訓練家能做到。最近的石室就在西邊。你願意試試嗎？","You solved a panel? Then that explains the cries we heard from below! Strange Pokémon shaped like letters have appeared in the inner chamber.":"你解開了一塊石板？難怪我們聽到下面有叫聲！內部大廳裡出現了形狀像文字的奇怪寶可夢。","We call them Unown. Every one has the shape of a letter. Please record the ones you catch in this.":"我們叫牠們未知圖騰。每一隻都是一個字母的形狀。請把你抓到的記在這裡面吧。","Each panel seems to set other letters free. Solve them all, and who knows what we will find!":"每塊石板好像都會放出不同的字母。全部解開的話，誰知道會發現什麼呢！","Panels solved: {n} of 4. They say the door of the Ho-Oh chamber only opens once the other three are whole.":"已解開的石板：{n}／4。聽說鳳王石室的門，要等另外三塊都拼好了才會打開。","All four panels, whole again! Now, can you catch every letter of the Unown? The report keeps count for you.":"四塊石板全都拼好了！那麼，你能把未知圖騰的每個字母都抓到嗎？筆記會幫你記著。","All twenty-six letters of the Unown! Thanks to you, we can finally begin to read the walls of the ruins.":"未知圖騰的二十六個字母全齊了！多虧了你，我們終於能開始解讀遺跡牆上的文字了。","The air of the chamber stirs. Shapes like letters flit across the walls... Pokémon!":"大廳裡的空氣動了起來。像文字一樣的影子在牆上飛來飛去……是寶可夢！","From every corner of the chamber, Unown come gliding out of the stone...":"未知圖騰從大廳的每個角落滑出了石壁……","They circle around you, letter after letter, then sink back into the walls one by one.":"牠們一個字母接一個字母地圍著你打轉，然後又一隻隻沉回了牆裡。","For a moment the carvings glow. The four panels are whole again, as they were long ago.":"一瞬間，牆上的浮雕發出了光芒。四塊石板又和很久很久以前一樣完整了。","Ruins of Alph, just to the south. Ancient stone chambers, and the Research Center.":"阿露福遺跡就在南邊。有古老的石室，還有研究所。","A great stone door, carved with a bird of many colours. It will not move.":"一扇巨大的石門，上面刻著一隻五彩的鳥。紋絲不動。","A stone slab blocks the stairs. The panel above must still be in pieces.":"一塊石板擋住了樓梯。上面那塊石板大概還是碎的。","The ruins hum with a strange power. My Pokémon and I came here to feel it. Let me show you what we learned!":"這片遺跡裡湧動著一股奇妙的力量。我和我的寶可夢是來感受它的。讓你看看我們學到了什麼！","The power of the ruins was not with me today.":"今天遺跡的力量沒有站在我這邊。","Xatu stand still all day, staring at the sun. Some say they can see both the past and the future.":"天然鳥一整天都一動不動地盯著太陽。聽說牠們能同時看見過去和未來。","I came all this way to see Pokémon shaped like letters! While I wait, look at the ones I already have!":"我大老遠跑來，就是為了看形狀像文字的寶可夢！等的時候，先看看我已經有的這些吧！","My collection was no match for yours...":"我的收藏比不過你的……","Smeargle paint their marks all over these ruins. I wonder if they learned it from the old carvings.":"圖圖犬在遺跡到處畫上自己的記號。不知道牠們是不是跟古老的浮雕學的。","The people who built these ruins left no names, only carvings. We think they lived side by side with Pokémon.":"建造這些遺跡的人沒有留下名字，只留下了浮雕。我們認為他們曾和寶可夢一起生活。","Ruins of Alph. Stone chambers built long ago, by no one knows whom. The Research Center is just to the east.":"阿露福遺跡。很久以前建造的石室，沒人知道是誰建的。研究所就在東邊。","Books about the ruins, full of drawings of strange letters.":"關於遺跡的書，裡面畫滿了奇怪的文字。","Rows of strange letters are carved into the wall, worn smooth by time.":"牆上刻著一排排奇怪的文字，已經被歲月磨得很平滑了。","Letters cover every wall of this chamber. They look a lot like the Pokémon that drift around in here.":"這間大廳的每面牆上都刻滿了文字。它們和在這裡飄來飄去的寶可夢長得很像。","Oh, and Professor Elm of New Bark Town called. He has news about Pokémon Eggs, and he would like to see you.":"對了，若葉鎮的空木博士打來電話。他說有關於寶可夢蛋的消息，想見見你。","...Wait. You are on your way to the Pokémon League too.":"……等等。你也要去寶可夢聯盟吧。","Since the Dragon's Den I keep thinking about what that old man said. I still do not get it. So I will find out the only way I know.":"從龍穴回來以後，我一直在想那個老頭說的話。我還是不明白。所以我要用我唯一知道的方法弄清楚。","Battle me. Here. Now.":"跟我對戰。就在這裡。現在。","Hmph. If that is all you have, the Elite Four will eat you alive. Get stronger.":"哼。如果你只有這點本事，四天王會把你生吞活剝的。去變強吧。","...I lost again. But my Pokémon kept fighting for me, every one of them, to the very end.":"……又輸了。但我的寶可夢一直在為我戰鬥，每一隻都堅持到了最後。","I only ever told them to win. I never once asked what they wanted.":"我只會命令牠們贏。從來沒問過牠們想要什麼。","Go on to the League. Next time we meet, I will battle with my Pokémon, not just give them orders.":"去聯盟吧。下次見面的時候，我會和我的寶可夢一起戰鬥，而不只是對牠們下命令。","The Indigo Plateau! The Pokémon League stands at the top of the road.":"石英高原！寶可夢聯盟就矗立在道路的盡頭。","With all eight of Johto's badges, the League's challenge for Johto's Trainers is open to you.":"集齊了城都的八枚徽章，聯盟為城都訓練家準備的挑戰向你敞開了。","Falkner of the Violet Gym trained here too. Go and see him. He is waiting for a worthy challenger.":"桔梗道館的阿速也在這裡修行過。去找他吧，他在等一位夠格的挑戰者。","There are Gyms in cities and towns all over Johto. Keep going, and your strongest Pokémon will listen to you again.":"城都各地的城鎮都有道館。繼續前進吧，你最強的寶可夢會重新聽你的話。","You have passed my test. Take this. It grows stronger the more your Pokémon trusts you.":"你通過了我的考驗。收下這個吧。寶可夢越信任你，它的威力就越強。","Yo, Champion of Kanto! Welcome to Johto's first Gym. Falkner uses Flying-type Pokémon.":"喲，關都的冠軍！歡迎來到城都的第一個道館。阿速用的是飛行屬性的寶可夢。","Electric, Ice and Rock moves will bring them down. And remember: here, Pokémon above level 20 might not listen until you win this badge.":"電、冰和岩石屬性的招式能把牠們打下來。還有，記住：在這裡，等級超過20的寶可夢在你拿到這枚徽章之前可能不聽話。","Here, take the Zephyr Badge. It is proof that you beat me.":"給，這是飛翼徽章。這是你打敗我的證明。","{player} received the Zephyr Badge from Falkner!":"{player}從阿速那裡得到了飛翼徽章！","With it, Pokémon up to level 25 will obey you, even ones raised far away.":"有了它，25級以下的寶可夢都會聽你的，就算是在遠方培養的也一樣。","And this: TM40, Aerial Ace. A move that never misses, like a bird diving on its prey.":"還有這個：招式學習器40，燕返。就像撲向獵物的鳥一樣，絕對不會落空的招式。","Sprout Tower was built around a great swaying pillar. It is said to come from a Bellsprout a hundred feet tall!":"喇叭芽之塔是圍著一根搖晃的大柱子建起來的。據說那根柱子來自一隻三十公尺高的喇叭芽！","Falkner uses bird Pokémon. Electric and Rock moves hit them hard. Do you have any?":"阿速用的是鳥寶可夢。電屬性和岩石屬性的招式對牠們很有效。你有嗎？","My strong Pokémon from Kanto just would not listen in Falkner's Gym. I had to win with the ones I raised here!":"我從關都帶來的強力寶可夢在阿速的道館裡就是不聽話。最後只能靠在這裡培養的寶可夢贏下來！","A Super Potion heals twice as much as a Potion. Worth every coin!":"好傷藥的效果是傷藥的兩倍。物有所值！","Welcome to the Pokémon Academy! Lesson one: a Pokémon that trusts you fights harder. Lesson two: walk with your Pokémon!":"歡迎來到寶可夢學校！第一課：信任你的寶可夢會戰鬥得更賣力。第二課：多和你的寶可夢一起走路！","I am learning about the time of day. Some Pokémon only come out at night, and Eevee evolves differently by day and by night!":"我在學習一天中的時間段。有些寶可夢只在晚上出現，伊布在白天和晚上的進化也不一樣！","Sprout Tower is a place of training. The Sages upstairs battle with Bellsprout, as flexible as the pillar itself.":"喇叭芽之塔是修行的地方。樓上的和尚們用喇叭芽對戰，牠們就像那根柱子一樣柔韌。","Edmond":"艾德","The pillar sways, and so do my Bellsprout. Can you keep your balance?":"柱子在搖，我的喇叭芽也在搖。你能保持平衡嗎？","I lost my balance...":"我失去平衡了……","Bend like the pillar, and nothing will break you.":"像柱子一樣柔韌，就沒有什麼能折斷你。","One Bellsprout, trained for many years. Let us battle!":"一隻喇叭芽，修行了好多年。來對戰吧！","Many years, and still not enough.":"修行了這麼多年，還是不夠啊。","The Elder is at the top. He tests every Trainer who climbs this tower.":"長老在塔頂。每個登上這座塔的訓練家，他都會考驗一番。","Troy":"阿特","Few reach the third floor. Show me why you did!":"很少有人能來到三樓。讓我看看你憑什麼！","Now I see why.":"現在我明白了。","The Elder is waiting. Go, and be humble.":"長老在等你。去吧，保持謙遜。","Neal":"阿尼","My Bellsprout and I have trained here since dawn!":"我和我的喇叭芽從天亮就在這裡修行了！","And we will train here until dusk.":"我們還要在這裡修行到天黑。","Hoothoot only stay awake at night. The Elder raised his own at midnight.":"咕咕只在晚上醒著。長老的咕咕就是在半夜養大的。","I am Li, the Elder of this tower. The Champion of Kanto, here? Then show me the bond you share with your Pokémon.":"我是這座塔的長老。關都的冠軍來了嗎？那就讓我看看你和寶可夢之間的羈絆吧。","Ah... your Pokémon trust you. That is the true strength.":"啊……你的寶可夢信任你。這才是真正的力量。","Elder Li":"長老","Wings need guts! We train from dawn to dusk to master bird Pokémon. Here I come!":"翅膀要靠膽量！我們從早練到晚，就是為了駕馭鳥寶可夢。上了！","Aaaargh!":"啊啊啊——！","Falkner is not just strong. He is a true master of bird Pokémon.":"阿速不只是強而已。他是真正的鳥寶可夢大師。","Abe":"阿貝","You want to face Falkner? Get past me first!":"想挑戰阿速？先過我這一關！","Beaten, just like that?":"就這樣輸了？","You have what it takes. Falkner is right ahead.":"你有這個實力。阿速就在前面。","I am Falkner, Leader of the Violet City Gym! Some say one jolt of electricity is enough to ground a bird. My father's birds and I will prove them wrong!":"我是桔梗市道館的館主阿速！有人說只要一記電擊就能把鳥打下來。我和父親的鳥寶可夢會證明他們錯了！","...You win. My birds and I still have much to learn.":"……你贏了。我和我的鳥寶可夢還有很多要學的。","Violet City. An old town of quiet scents, with Sprout Tower at its heart.":"桔梗市。飄著淡淡清香的古老城市，喇叭芽之塔就在它的中心。","Violet City Pokémon Gym. Leader: Falkner, who soars with Flying-type Pokémon!":"桔梗市寶可夢道館。館主：阿速，與飛行屬性寶可夢一同翱翔！","The great pillar sways gently, but it never falls. They say it is the trunk of a giant Bellsprout.":"大柱子輕輕搖晃著，卻從來不會倒下。據說那是一隻巨大喇叭芽的身體。","West of the city, a strange tree blocks the road north on Route 36. It wiggles when nobody is looking! South of here, Route 32 leads to Union Cave.":"城市西邊的36號道路上，有一棵奇怪的樹擋住了往北的路。沒人看的時候它還會扭來扭去！往南走，32號道路通往互連洞。","Old Sailor":"老水手","Fifty years I sailed around the Whirl Islands. My Pokémon and I learned how to calm their whirlpools.":"我在漩渦列島一帶航行了五十年。我和我的寶可夢學會了怎麼讓那裡的漩渦平靜下來。","Shall I teach Whirlpool to one of your Pokémon?":"要我教你的寶可夢潮旋嗎？","With the Glacier Badge, Whirlpool calms the whirlpools out at sea. Mind the currents!":"有了冰雪徽章，潮旋就能讓海上的漩渦平靜下來。小心海流啊！","The still water of the chamber begins to stir, although there is no wind...":"明明沒有風，洞室裡平靜的水面卻開始波動……","The Silver Wing glows. A great silver Pokémon raises its head from the water!":"銀色之羽發出了光芒。一隻巨大的銀色寶可夢從水中抬起了頭！","Lugia is still there, watching you in silence.":"洛奇亞還在那裡，靜靜地注視著你。","The chamber falls silent. Far above, the whirlpools around the islands grow calm for a moment.":"洞室安靜了下來。在遙遠的上方，群島周圍的漩渦也平息了片刻。","A cold current pours up out of the hole below. Something down there does not want visitors.":"下方的洞口湧上一股冰冷的水流。下面似乎有什麼東西不想被人打擾。","Hail":"冰雹","You did it.":"你做到了。","The big one got away.":"大的那條跑了。","Joe":"喬","Worth the wait.":"沒白等。","Megan":"梅根","Your party was full, so {mon} went to your PC.":"你的隊伍滿了，所以{mon}被送到了電腦裡。"},"zh-Hant",""]);
